<p>Most templated WordPress sites overwhelm the browser, denying visibility to disabled people, failing Core Web Vitals and <a href="/ada-website-compliance-checklist">ADA compliance tests</a>.</p>
<p><strong>You’re not just losing traffic, you’re opening the door to legal risks and reputational damage.</strong></p>
<p>Themes and builders fall short of the demands of an enterprise WordPress website.</p>
<p>Before choosing an agency, you need to choose the framework.</p>
