<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Unfortunately, there are no available statistics for Facebook&#8217;s average values of average conversion rate even though this is another fast-growing industry. However, since the dating industry is based on apps, we will lean on data from Google where the average Click through rate is 6.05%, while the average CPC equals $1.16, and the conversion rate is up to 9.64%! The results on conversion rate are becoming even better, if we take a look at data from Google Play Store where the average conversion rate for the dating industry amounts to 25.8%.</span></li>
