<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><b>Science and nature</b><span style="font-weight: 400;">: </span><a href="https://spaceplace.nasa.gov/blue-sky/en/"><span style="font-weight: 400;">NASA</span></a><span style="font-weight: 400;"> &#8211; speed score of 92</span></li>
