<h2 id="what"><span data-preserver-spaces="true">What is Taplio?</span></h2>
<p><span data-preserver-spaces="true"><a href="https://taplio.com/?via=AlphaEfficiency">Taplio</a> is an AI-powered tool that can help you enhance your LinkedIn content creation process by generating ideas for your posts. It was founded in 2022 by Alex Berman and Tom Jacquesson with the goal of helping both businesses and individual users thrive on this popular platform without hiring social media marketing agencies. </span></p>
<p><span data-preserver-spaces="true">After paying for the subscription, you will be able to access Taplio from your browser. It is also a good idea to install Taplio Stats &#8211; an extension for Google Chrome that provides quick access to key metrics and content inspiration while browsing LinkedIn.</span></p>
<h2 id="benefits"><span data-preserver-spaces="true">Main benefits of using Taplio</span></h2>
<p><span data-preserver-spaces="true">You might have used some of the selling tools for social media channels before and found them more or less helpful. To save you time and other valuable resources, we at Alpha Efficiency decided to conduct extensive tests on Taplio. In this section, we will show you which benefits you can expect from using this tool that emerged as a new trend among successful LinkedIn creators:</span></p>
<h4>Boost your content creation process with AI</h4>
<p><span data-preserver-spaces="true">From generating content ideas to actually writing posts, Taplio provides tools that both businesses and individual persons will find helpful.</span></p>
<p><span data-preserver-spaces="true">Getting ideas for high-quality content might be easy right at the beginning of your LinkedIn journey; however, after months and years of actively posting on this social media network, finding fresh ideas for your posts can become exhausting. Taplio is one of the best available selling tools for businesses and individuals who want to boost their content creation process.</span></p>
<p><span data-preserver-spaces="true">Taplio not only helps you generate content ideas by analyzing viral posts and industry trends, but it also allows you to insert an already existing text and use an AI rewrite tool to make it become unique. When you are on a tight schedule, you can use AI generate content option to publish fresh posts within minutes. All this combined makes Taplio one of the most useful selling tools when it comes to content creation.</span></p>
<h4>It is easy to schedule your posts with Taplio</h4>
<p><span data-preserver-spaces="true">Keeping track of your content publication can be time-consuming, especially for business owners who already have a variety of tasks that require completion in front of them. That&#8217;s one of the main reasons why many people look for selling tools with a feature that allows them to schedule posts. However, if you want to drive online business growth, it is crucial to learn more about the </span><a class="editor-rtfLink" href="/the-best-time-to-post-on-social-media" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span data-preserver-spaces="true">best time to post to social media</span></a><span data-preserver-spaces="true">, depending on your goals and business model. After you determine the ideal time for your posts to go live on LinkedIn, you can use the preview option to check how it will look once published and then schedule it in Taplio within just a few clicks.</span></p>
<p><span data-preserver-spaces="true">Automating content scheduling allows businesses to assign employees to more complex job roles. Individuals who regularly post on LinkedIn can also benefit from it by not having to worry about accessing the internet browser at an ideal time for publishing posts.</span></p>
<h4>Taplio can help you generate more leads</h4>
<p><span data-preserver-spaces="true">If lead generation is the primary goal you want to achieve with your LinkedIn activity, you&#8217;re going to find some of Taplio&#8217;s features very useful. For example, the auto DM feature can help you automate the process of sending direct messages to people who interact with your content, and you can adjust this automation tool to send customized messages under specific circumstances. Bulk messaging is also available &#8211; you can create lists of people depending on their interactions on LinkedIn and then quickly send customized messages to each group. All this makes Taplio one of the most helpful CRM tools within the social media industry.</span></p>
<h4>Improve your LinkedIn strategy with analytics tools</h4>
<p><span data-preserver-spaces="true">Adjusting your LinkedIn strategy based on your content performance is a must if you want to grow your business or personal brand faster. While user interfaces on some other selling tools tend to be overcomplicated, Taplio does a great job summarizing the most important KPIs content creators need to follow to achieve success in social media advertising. You can quickly check what posts are performing the best, and in case you are interested in detailed posts performance, there is a separate tab. That makes Taplio very insightful, and you won&#8217;t have much trouble getting a good grasp on the user interface. By allowing you to analyze the performance of your posts easily, Taplio helps you quickly identify what type of content is the most beneficial.</span></p>
<p><span data-preserver-spaces="true">This LinkedIn growth tool also provides you with an option to analyze how your organization is performing as a whole or check the performance of each member separately. Taplio&#8217;s analytics tools allow you to improve your LinkedIn strategy and drive more business.</span></p>
<h2 id="improve"><span data-preserver-spaces="true">How can Taplio improve your business/brand?</span></h2>
<p><span data-preserver-spaces="true">As a business-driven platform, LinkedIn is an excellent place for promoting your company and its culture. Providing high-quality content is the best way to improve brand awareness and open new business opportunities on this platform. However, as keeping track of viral posts, generating content ideas, and generating leads on LinkedIn requires a lot of time, many business owners seek help from social media marketing agencies or hire professionals to work in their company and take care of its LinkedIn activity. Unfortunately, in most cases, this is still not enough to maximize your online business growth &#8211; especially if the competition utilizes AI-powered social selling tools to create valuable content and connect with potential clients effortlessly.</span></p>
<p><span data-preserver-spaces="true">By using Taplio, one of the best currently available LinkedIn growth tools, you can save time and money for your business while boosting your brand image, connecting with wider audiences, and driving more conversions. Detailed insights Taplio provides can help your business stay relevant within its industry by allowing you to create viral posts within 10 minutes without hiring professional services.</span></p>
<p><span data-preserver-spaces="true">In addition, this tool can help your team members in their attempt to build personal brands on LinkedIn. And considering that LinkedIn is one of the most popular social media communities, especially for business-related interactions, improving the personal branding of each team member can create additional opportunities for a company as a whole. Taplio can also make your </span><a class="editor-rtfLink" href="/social-media-monitoring" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span data-preserver-spaces="true">social media monitoring</span></a><span data-preserver-spaces="true"> more efficient &#8211; allowing you to track KPIs easily. </span></p>
<p><span data-preserver-spaces="true">However, keep in mind that Taplio can be a handy tool for an individual person too. If you are a freelancer seeking job opportunities or an individual looking to land a job by building your brand, Taplio can help you improve the quality of your content and save you valuable time by automating boring tasks.</span></p>
<h2 id="pricing"><span data-preserver-spaces="true">Taplio pricing</span></h2>
<p><span data-preserver-spaces="true">Taplio uses a subscription-based pricing model, which is very straightforward. With only one available plan that costs $39 per month, you will get all the necessary features for achieving LinkedIn growth. That includes, but is not limited to:</span></p>
<ul>
<li><span data-preserver-spaces="true">Industry news and the library with more than 3 million viral posts that will help you get inspiration</span></li>
<li><span data-preserver-spaces="true">AI assistant for writing high-quality content</span></li>
<li><span data-preserver-spaces="true">Auto DM and Auto Plug features</span></li>
<li><span data-preserver-spaces="true">Tools for sending personalized DMs within clicks</span></li>
<li><span data-preserver-spaces="true">Option to integrate it with your CRM</span></li>
<li><span data-preserver-spaces="true">Necessary analytics tools</span></li>
</ul>
<p><span data-preserver-spaces="true">If you are unsure whether Taplio will prove useful for you, there is also a 7-day free trial option, during which you can test all the features available in the paid version. It is more than enough time to test the functions we have written about in this article and taste some of the benefits of using Taplio. After that, you can decide if this tool fits your needs and continue with the subscription plan. Keep in mind that by using coupon codes&amp;promo codes, you can get Taplio for a reduced price.</span></p>
<h3>Something Better Than Taplio Promo Code</h3>
<p>I know that many of you are looking for a great steal on social media management services. Given that I am very familiar with Alex behind Taplio, I can tell you that you don&#8217;t need to waste too much time on looking for promo codes. They rarely, if ever, push them. But they have something else in store for people looking for deals. If you connect your Taplio account with your <a href="/tweet-hunter-review">Tweet Hunter</a> account, you will achieve a whopping 25% recurring monthly savings on both accounts! That&#8217;s a cheat code right there, and I can manage my Twitter and LinkedIn accounts similarly.</p>
<h2 id="is-it-worth"><span data-preserver-spaces="true">Is Taplio worth the money?</span></h2>
<p><span data-preserver-spaces="true">Yes, without any doubt! And this stands for both businesses and individuals who need help with building personal brands. If you are struggling to keep up with your ideal content schedule on LinkedIn due to a lack of inspiration or simply because you don&#8217;t have enough time to post on social media regularly, are struggling to generate leads, or feel like your overall branding strategy needs improvement &#8211; Taplio and similar selling tools are definitely worth investing money in. </span></p>
<p><strong><span data-preserver-spaces="true">Are you ready to thrive on LinkedIn? </span></strong><a class="editor-rtfLink" href="https://taplio.com/?via=AlphaEfficiency" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span data-preserver-spaces="true">Create a free account </span></a><span data-preserver-spaces="true">to start your Taplio journey today, and quickly you will learn why it is considered the best tool for boosting your online presence!  </span></p>
<p><span data-preserver-spaces="true">If you believe this article helped you better understand Taplio, you can find more useful online selling tools in the </span><a class="editor-rtfLink" href="/category/app" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span data-preserver-spaces="true">tools review</span></a><span data-preserver-spaces="true"> section on our website.</span></p>','https://alphaefficiency.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/11/taplioreview.webp',NULL,'[]','[166,347]','2022-11-17T11:20:22','2022-11-17T11:20:22',1640,5,1),
  (18457,'/tweet-hunter-review','tweet-hunter-review','post','blog','Tweet Hunter Review: Is this the best Twitter tool?','Tweet Hunter Review: Is this the best Twitter tool? - Alpha Efficiency.™','As many people currently talk about Tweet Hunter, our digital marketing agency decided to test it for you.','https://alphaefficiency.com/tweet-hunter-review',1,'Whether you use Twitter for business or personal purposes, achieving growth on this social media platform requires a lot of effort and consistency in publishing original content, establishing high-quality relationships with other users, following trends within your field of interest, and more. Luckily, you can use different Twitter tools to stay on track during this &hellip; Continued','<p><span data-preserver-spaces="true">Whether you use Twitter for business or personal purposes, achieving growth on this social media platform requires a lot of effort and consistency in publishing original content, establishing high-quality relationships with other users, following trends within your field of interest, and more. Luckily, you can use different Twitter tools to stay on track during this process. However, it is crucial to choose wisely, as not each one of them will be able to support your goals and ideas. </span><span data-preserver-spaces="true">As many people currently talk about Tweet Hunter, our </span><a class="editor-rtfLink" href="/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span data-preserver-spaces="true">digital marketing agency</span></a><span data-preserver-spaces="true"> decided to test it for you. Keep reading to get a detailed insight into all pros and cons of this emerging Twitter growth tool.</span></p>
<h5>Table of Contents</h5>
<ul>
<li><a href="/#what-is">What is Tweet Hunter?</a></li>
<li><a href="/#features">4 key features of Tweet Hunter</a></li>
<li><a href="/#grow">6 ways that Tweet Hunter helps you grow on Twitter</a></li>
<li><a href="/#benefits">Tweet Hunter Review: What do we love the most?</a></li>
<li><a href="/#cost">How much does it cost to use Tweet Hunter?</a></li>
</ul>
<img src="https://alphaefficiency.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/11/tweethunterreview-1024x576.png" alt="tweet hunter pro twitter tool review" width="1024" height="576" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
<h2><span data-preserver-spaces="true">What is Tweet Hunter?</span></h2>
<p><span data-preserver-spaces="true">Created in May 2021 by Thibault Louis-Lucas and Thomas Jacquesson, <a href="http://tweethunter.io/?via=AlphaEfficiency">Tweet Hunter</a> is an all-in-one Twitter growth tool that can help you write viral tweets. Moreover, you can use it to analyze the performance of your Twitter account, manage customer relationships, and create advanced strategies to achieve business objectives on this popular social media platform. This tool is designed to help you better target your audience, create more business opportunities and monetize your efforts. No matter how many followers you currently have on your Twitter account and how many viral tweets you wrote in the past &#8211; using Tweet Hunter can make your further progress easier.</span></p>
<h2><span data-preserver-spaces="true">Key Features of Tweet Hunter</span></h2>
<p><span data-preserver-spaces="true">When choosing between different Twitter Tools you can use to grow your account, it is only natural to look for one that provides a wide range of useful features in one package. Tweet Hunter does precisely that, as its features can be classified into the following categories:</span></p>
<h3>AI writing assistant</h3>
<p><span data-preserver-spaces="true">Content is a crucial piece of the puzzle in </span><a class="editor-rtfLink" href="/social-media-advertising" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span data-preserver-spaces="true">social media advertising</span></a><span data-preserver-spaces="true">, but constantly outperforming your competition in this field can become challenging. If you are having trouble regularly coming up with new tweets or want to improve your content&#8217;s quality without relying on <a href="/twitter-ghostwriting">Twitter Ghostwriting Services</a>, Tweet Hunter&#8217;s AI writing assistant could prove beneficial for you. It can help you generate thread ideas, write better hooks for grabbing a reader&#8217;s attention, rewrite tweets, obtain ready-to-use custom tweets daily, and predict your tweets&#8217; performance before publishing them. That can save you valuable time, get you out of writer&#8217;s block, and open opportunities for crafting different content strategies.</span></p>
<h3>CRM tools</h3>
<p><span data-preserver-spaces="true">Businesses that use Twitter to increase sales need to focus on building high-quality relationships with potential customers. Tweet Hunter&#8217;s CRM features can help you better connect with people across this social media platform. Besides allowing you to utilize artificial intelligence to find new leads, this tool can also help you reply to specific people&#8217;s tweets or tweets within your niche more easily. You can also use AI to craft the best possible replies, import or create lists of people based on past interactions or any other criteria, quickly reply to all your mentions, and more. </span></p>
<h3>Schedulings and Automations</h3>
<p><span data-preserver-spaces="true">Keeping up with publishing content during the </span><a class="editor-rtfLink" href="/the-best-time-to-post-on-social-media" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span data-preserver-spaces="true">best time to post on social media</span></a><span data-preserver-spaces="true"> can be difficult, as you&#8217;ll often be occupied with other tasks during those hours. That&#8217;s why using Twitter tools that offer tweet scheduling option is crucial for securing growth. We found Tweet Hunter&#8217;s scheduling to work perfectly, and besides that, you&#8217;ll get access to various automation tools. For example, Tweet Hunter provides an Auto DM feature that allows you to automatically send direct messages based on your interactions with people on this social media platform.</span></p>
<p><span data-preserver-spaces="true">You can also turn on random retweets of your well-performing content and even select an option to remove those retweets after a couple of hours in order to clean your profile. Tweet Hunter can also help you prevent spamming your threads by automatically delaying tweets. </span></p>
<h3>Advanced Twitter Analytics</h3>
<p><span data-preserver-spaces="true">Tweet Hunter makes monitoring key metrics easy. You won&#8217;t have to worry about keeping track of your follower growth rate, advanced tweet performance analysis, and sorting your tweets by their performance. This tool also allows you to share the history of your progress with others.</span></p>
<h2><span data-preserver-spaces="true">How Tweet Hunter can help you grow on Twitter</span></h2>
<p><span data-preserver-spaces="true">Now that we know Tweet Hunter&#8217;s key features, it is time to learn how putting them to use can help you achieve success. As you are probably aware already, growing on Twitter requires more than setting up an attractive account profile picture and occasionally publishing tweets in the hope people will reach out to you. Instead, you need to constantly invest time and energy into coming up with original content ideas, finding new leads, and analyzing the performance of your account. However, this can lead to burnout, and that&#8217;s why we recommend getting yourself a tool that can support your efforts to achieve Twitter growth. After conducting extensive tests, we found out that Tweet Hunter can help you:</span></p>
<h4>Write better content</h4>
<p><span data-preserver-spaces="true">While you might have a lot of content inspiration at the beginning of your Twitter journey, coming up with original brand tweets is likely to become difficult after some time. That is especially true if you are on a tight schedule and don&#8217;t have much space to dedicate to browsing this social media platform in order to find high-performing content you can use as inspiration. Tweet Hunter&#8217;s 2M+ tweets library can help you obtain fresh content ideas more easily. Just type in a keyword; this tool will provide you with all the viral tweets containing that keyword. You can also obtain inspiration from a library with over 4 thousand hand-picked tweets that are performing well. This growth tool gives you an insight into the most famous content formats you can use to improve the quality of your tweets and make them people&#8217;s favorites when exploring </span><a class="editor-rtfLink" href="/early-morning-social-media-routine-and-why-it-could-be-productive" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span data-preserver-spaces="true">social media in the morning</span></a><span data-preserver-spaces="true">.</span></p>
<p><span data-preserver-spaces="true">However, if inspiration libraries are not of enough help for you, Tweet Hunter also offers an AI writing assistant that can help you generate original content within just a few clicks. All of this, combined with another feature, which allows you to see the prediction of the performance of your tweets right before publishing them, makes Tweet Hunter a powerful traffic-driving machine. And whenever you get a tweet inspiration, you can write it down and schedule it for publishing in the future. </span></p>
<h4>Connect with others</h4>
<p><span data-preserver-spaces="true">As we have already mentioned, building solid relationships with your target audience on Twitter is a powerful way to increase sales for your business. Tweet Hunter provides tools that allow you to analyze and rewrite your past content people loved the most, extract user data from your competition&#8217;s tweets and engage with their audience, find accounts similar to your already existing clients and prospects, send auto DMs, and more. All this makes it a perfect Twitter audience growth tool and customer acquisition engine that can support your efforts of establishing a strong presence on this social media platform and turning leads into regular clients.</span></p>
<h4>Craft better strategies by understanding your Twitter account performance<span data-preserver-spaces="true"> </span></h4>
<p><span data-preserver-spaces="true">You can use Tweet Hunter&#8217;s advanced Twitter analytics to get better insight into the performance of your current strategies and use that knowledge to adjust them accordingly. For example, Tweet Hunter provides you with quick access to detailed stats for your previous tweets, such as profile visits, likes, and replies generated, so you can then use AI to write similar content. It is also worth mentioning that this tool allows you to sort all your tweets by their performance or publish date. That way, you can see what content format your audience finds most engaging and the exact time of the day you should publish tweets in the future for the best possible outcome.</span></p>
<h4>Grow your email list or promote products with the Auto Plug feature</h4>
<p><span data-preserver-spaces="true">Promoting a product or growing your email list by sharing links on Twitter can take a lot of work due to the limited reach. The best way to increase your reach is to plug a tweet just after your initial tweet performs well. Tweet Hunter&#8217;s Auto Plug feature allows you to set a specific threshold, and every time your tweets pass it, a link to your product pages or newsletter will be published. </span></p>
<h4>Make your profile look fresh by deleting retweets</h4>
<p><span data-preserver-spaces="true">Besides allowing you to support other users&#8217; efforts, the retweet option on Twitter is also a powerful way to target people in different time zones if you are using it to retweet your own content. However, retweets can stack up over long periods and make it look like you are not producing much fresh content. As manually removing retweets from your profile can be a time-consuming task, Tweet Hunter&#8217;s feature which allows you to delete all of your retweets in one click. Cleaning your profile will help you highlight your fresh tweets to new visitors and make it clear that you are actively producing original content. That should help you improve the quality of your Twitter audience.</span></p>
<h4>Save time</h4>
<p><span data-preserver-spaces="true">Growing on Twitter requires repeatedly completing specific tasks, which can become very time-consuming once you acquire a large follower base. Tweet Hunter helps you automate boring tasks such as retweeting your own content, sending giveaway gifts to people in DM, manually reaching out to users who interact with your tweets, removing retweets from your profile after a specific period, and more. That&#8217;s especially useful for startup founders who could benefit from having more time to focus on other aspects of growing a business. Tweet Hunter makes the whole experience of growing your Twitter account much less energy-draining.</span></p>
<p><span data-preserver-spaces="true">After signing up on Tweet Hunter, you&#8217;ll receive a comprehensive guide on growing your Twitter account. That can help you avoid the usual social media missteps people make when starting out, one of them being prioritizing the number of followers instead of focusing on building quality relationships with people interested in similar topics.</span></p>
<h2><span data-preserver-spaces="true">Tweet Hunter Review: What do we love the most?</span></h2>
<p><span data-preserver-spaces="true">What we enjoy the most about using Tweet Hunter is its versatility. It is truly an all-in-one Twitter growth tool capable of supporting a wide range of tactics for expanding your sphere of influence on this social media platform. Whether you want to boost your personal brand by writing quality content, increase the number of sales for your business by acquiring new leads, or enhance your </span><a class="editor-rtfLink" href="/social-media-monitoring" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span data-preserver-spaces="true">social media monitoring</span></a><span data-preserver-spaces="true"> by obtaining more insightful data- Tweet Hunter will provide you with all the necessary tools for executing your strategies to perfection.</span></p>
<p><span data-preserver-spaces="true">Another thing we really loved about Tweet Hunter is the fact that its creators invest lots of effort to constantly make this tool better. They regularly update this tool and add new features that users can use to quickly achieve Twitter growth. That makes us feel optimistic about Tweet Hunter&#8217;s future.</span></p>
<h2><span data-preserver-spaces="true">What is Tweet Hunter missing</span></h2>
<p><span data-preserver-spaces="true">A wide range of features makes Tweet Hunter one of the best all-in-one Twitter growth tools. However, we believe this tool could become even better if the team behind it introduced a real-time analytics feature. Even though it allows you to see detailed metrics for the past 7, 30, or 90 days &#8211; the ability to track performance in real-time could prove beneficial in a few cases. Still, compared to the competition, Tweet Hunter is the most versatile tool currently available for those who want to make their progress on Twitter as smooth as possible.</span></p>
<h2><span data-preserver-spaces="true">Is it safe to use Tweet Hunter?</span></h2>
<p><span data-preserver-spaces="true">If you are looking for some magical tool for executing follower growth hacks and prohibited tactics that only work short-term, Tweet Hunter may not be the right choice for you. This tool is designed to support the efforts and make lives easier for users who understand that Twitter growth requires constant investments of time and energy. Copying other people&#8217;s content and spamming users is against the policy of this social media company, which is why you need to use any Twitter tool in a smart way and learn how to properly utilize its features to minimize the platform risk. Fortunately, Tweet Hunter has a spam protection feature that can help you ensure that your content is in accordance with Twitter&#8217;s policies.</span></p>
<h2><span data-preserver-spaces="true">How much does it cost to use Tweet Hunter?</span></h2>
<p><span data-preserver-spaces="true">Tweet Hunter pricing starts from $49 per month, and this plan includes all the features except the AI content generation tool. If you want a superior plan, which includes all the features &#8211; you&#8217;ll have to pay $99 monthly. </span></p>
<p><span data-preserver-spaces="true">However, you can try this all-in-one Twitter growth tool for free during the 7-day trial, and if you need more time to decide whether you like it, Tweet Hunter also has a 30-day refund policy. In theory, you can test Tweet Hunter for 37 days without paying a single dollar. And depending on the size of your account, you can even get a customized enterprise plan.</span></p>
<p><span data-preserver-spaces="true">Once you pay for a monthly subscription, you can add as many Twitter accounts on Tweet Hunter as you like without additional cost. And you&#8217;ll also be able to use a Tweet Hunter for ghostwriting for multiple clients from one account.</span></p>
<h3><span data-preserver-spaces="true">Is Tweet Hunter worth the money?</span></h3>
<p><span data-preserver-spaces="true">Yes &#8211; Tweet Hunter is one of the best Twitter growth tools currently existing, and it can help you generate much more than $99 per month. Startup founders, social media managers, or even individuals trying to boost their brand could benefit from its advanced artificial intelligence, automation, and analytical tools. No matter your current account size, Tweet Hunter can help you save a lot of time and nerves moving forward in your Twitter journey. </span></p>
<p><span data-preserver-spaces="true">Are you ready to start growing your Twitter account?</span><a class="editor-rtfLink" href="http://tweethunter.io/?via=AlphaEfficiency" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span data-preserver-spaces="true"> Create an account</span></a><span data-preserver-spaces="true"> and find out why we consider Tweet Hunter to be the necessary tool for building a successful online presence.</span></p>','https://alphaefficiency.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/11/tweethunterreview-1024x576-1.webp',NULL,'[]','[166,347]','2022-11-23T13:39:34','2022-11-23T13:39:34',2310,6,1);
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO pages (wp_id,path,slug,type,track,title,meta_title,meta_description,canonical,robots_index,excerpt,body_html,hero_image,wp_template,tags,categories,published_at,updated_at,word_count,internal_links,image_count) VALUES
  (18471,'/will-web-development-become-obsolete','will-web-development-become-obsolete','post','blog','Will web development become obsolete?','Will web development become obsolete? - Alpha Efficiency.™','Experts from Alpha Efficiency will give you their take on the emerging question of whether web development will become obsolete or not.','https://alphaefficiency.com/will-web-development-become-obsolete',1,'Throughout human evolution, advancement in technology has led to people losing their jobs because the machine or a tool could do it more efficiently. The recent rise of drag-and-drop website building platforms and artificial intelligence machine learning technology makes many predict web development dying due to a decrease in demand for custom-coded websites that might occur &hellip; Continued','<p><span data-preserver-spaces="true">Throughout human evolution, advancement in technology has led to people losing their jobs because the machine or a tool could do it more efficiently. The recent rise of drag-and-drop website building platforms and artificial intelligence machine learning technology makes many predict web development dying due to a decrease in demand for </span><a class="editor-rtfLink" href="/custom-coded-websites" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span data-preserver-spaces="true">custom-coded websites </span></a><span data-preserver-spaces="true">that might occur in the near future. </span><span data-preserver-spaces="true">Today, experts from Alpha Efficiency will give you their take on the emerging question of whether <strong>web development will become obsolete or not</strong>. Keep reading to find out if it&#8217;s a good idea to start a web development or web design career in the era of self-driving cars and machine learning algorithms.</span></p>
<h5>Table of Contents</h5>
<ul>
<li><a href="/#builders">Is there a need for developers while DIY web builder platforms rise?</a></li>
<li><a href="/#wix-elementor">Why Wix and Elementor Don&#8217;t Work for Small Business Owners?</a></li>
<li><a href="/#designers-and-developers">Will Web Designers and Web Developers Become Obsolete?</a></li>
<li><a href="/#AI">Will AI replace web developers?</a></li>
<li><a href="/#final">Final thoughts</a></li>
</ul>
<img src="https://alphaefficiency.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/11/webdevobsolete1-1024x768-1.webp" alt="web development will become obsolete or not" width="1024" height="768" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
<h2 id="builders"><span data-preserver-spaces="true">Is there a need for developers while DIY web builder platforms rise?</span></h2>
<p><span data-preserver-spaces="true">Recently, we have witnessed the rise in popularity of DIY web-building platforms that allow people to create a website without any coding knowledge. But will web development become obsolete when more and more business owners start looking for no-code solutions instead of building </span><a class="editor-rtfLink" href="/website-builders-or-hard-coding" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span data-preserver-spaces="true">hard-coded websites</span></a><span data-preserver-spaces="true">?</span></p>
<p><span data-preserver-spaces="true">Even though no-code development platforms will become better in the future, it is unlikely that they will be able to handle complex data like professional web development and web design agency. Our prediction is that DIY platforms will become a go-to choice for smaller web development jobs, while bigger jobs and advanced tasks will still be reserved for expert web developers. </span></p>
<h3 id="wix-elementor"><span data-preserver-spaces="true">Why Wix and Elementor Don&#8217;t Work for Small Business Owners?</span></h3>
<img src="https://alphaefficiency.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/11/wixandelementor-1024x768.png" alt="wix and elementor are they good" width="1024" height="768" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
<p><span data-preserver-spaces="true">Website-building platforms are a go-to option for quickly creating a website, but custom code is more customizable and efficient. </span><a class="editor-rtfLink" href="/websites-built-with-elementor" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span data-preserver-spaces="true">Sites built with Elementor</span></a><span data-preserver-spaces="true"> and other drag-n-drop development platforms come with severe limitations that can prevent small businesses&#8217; online growth. With custom code, you can create a website exactly the way you want it to fit your business needs perfectly. While no-code solutions might be tempting for small business owners without coding knowledge, choosing this approach usually proves to be a huge mistake for various reasons.</span></p>
<p><span data-preserver-spaces="true">These limitations need to be kept in mind when analyzing whether web development will become obsolete in the near future:</span></p>
<h4>Lack of scalability</h4>
<p><span data-preserver-spaces="true">Websites built with a page builder, such as Wix or Elementor, might be easy to create; however, these websites are not scalable. Using a page builder will likely result in slow loading times and poor performance if you have a large website. When building a website for your small business, you need to keep future expansions in mind. While you probably won&#8217;t witness a lot of traffic shortly after launching a website, the number of simultaneous visitors will increase as your business grows. Small business owners who want their website to be able to handle a large amount of traffic without any trouble need to hire professional web developers to build it from scratch.</span></p>
<p><span data-preserver-spaces="true">And if you opt for page builders, the lack of options for exporting code will prove costly once you decide that it&#8217;s time to upgrade features or move to another content management system.</span></p>
<h4>Lack of uniqueness in design</h4>
<p><span data-preserver-spaces="true">As a small business owner, your goal should be to increase brand awareness and make your company stand out in the competitive online sphere. For that purpose, you need a web design that will truly reflect your brand identity system and allow you to connect with the target audience. However, no matter the time and effort you invest into creating a website on drag-and-drop web development platforms, you won&#8217;t be able to achieve a completely unique look. Websites built with Wix, Elementor, and other page builders all look similar to some extent since they were built using the same templates, fonts, plugins, etc.</span></p>
<p><span data-preserver-spaces="true">The need for tailor-made websites keeps the demand for professional web developers and web designers high among both corporations and small businesses. However, keep in mind that no-code web development platforms will keep evolving, and they might reduce the demand for front-end development jobs in the future. Still, a human factor is likely to remain important in the branding aspect of building a website.</span></p>
<h4>Vulnerability to hacking</h4>
<p><span data-preserver-spaces="true">Website security should be one of the top priorities for small business owners because any data breach can lead to lasting consequences in client relationships. For example, if you were running a medical business &#8211; letting hackers obtain your patients&#8217; accurate medical records will indeed prove disastrous. But why are websites created with page builders more vulnerable than the ones built by professional web designers?</span></p>
<p><span data-preserver-spaces="true">Bloated code that DIY platforms generate makes websites more vulnerable to hacker attacks. Since many business owners use page builders, hackers invest efforts into finding vulnerabilities in popular no-code web development platforms. By hiring a professional web design agency, you will get a team of experts dedicated to protecting your business website. Their web design problem solvers will regularly audit your website&#8217;s security and make necessary updates to keep your customers&#8217; privacy safe.</span></p>
<h4>Slow page speeds</h4>
<p><span data-preserver-spaces="true">Ensuring your web pages load fast is crucial when running an online business. Slow websites can cause a lot of problems by ruining the user experience and causing high bounce rates. Websites built with <a href="http://wix.com">Wix</a>, <a href="http://elementor.com">Elementor</a>, and other page builders come with a lot of unnecessary code lines that will cause slow loading times for your pages. And to get all the desired features, you&#8217;ll need to install additional plugins that can further ruin your website speed.</span></p>
<p><span data-preserver-spaces="true">On the other hand, experienced web developers and web designers know how to utilize clean code to build a completely functional, visually appealing, and fast website that provides an enhanced user experience and performs well in search engines.</span><span data-preserver-spaces="true"> </span></p>
<img src="https://alphaefficiency.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/11/fastvsslowwebsite-1024x768.png" alt="page builder vs custom coded website" width="1024" height="768" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
<h4>Bad SEO performance</h4>
<p><span data-preserver-spaces="true">Increasing the organic amount of traffic is essential for every small business because running extensive PPC campaigns can be expensive. But to be able to obtain more visits from search engines, your website needs to be built with the best SEO web design practices in mind. There are many different factors that Google and other search engines take into account when deciding which pages to rank high, and hiring professionals who know how to build websites that satisfy Web Core Vitals is a much better option for small business owners than using drag-and-drop development platforms. Since the demand for well-optimized websites is high, we don&#8217;t see web development dying in the near future because of Wix, Elementor, and other page builders.</span><span data-preserver-spaces="true"> </span></p>
<h2 id="designers-and-developers"><span data-preserver-spaces="true">Will Web Designers and Web Developers Become Obsolete?</span></h2>
<p><span data-preserver-spaces="true">No, web development and web design will not become obsolete. In fact, those are among the most in-demand skills in the market today, and by choosing a web development or web design career, you won&#8217;t make a mistake. There are many reasons for this. First, the demand for web development services is growing because more and more businesses are looking for ways to improve their online presence. And there is still no better way to build a unique website than coding it from scratch. Even though no-code development platforms will improve in the future, it is unlikely that they will be able to handle complex data like professional web development and web design agency.</span></p>
<p><span data-preserver-spaces="true">However, what concerns many web developers besides the evolution of page builders are advancements in AI machine learning technology. Keep reading to find out whether web development will become obsolete because of machine learning algorithms or not.</span></p>
<h2 id="AI"><span data-preserver-spaces="true">Will AI replace web developers?</span></h2>
<p><span data-preserver-spaces="true">Artificial intelligence computer science deals with the design of intelligent agents, which are systems that can reason, learn, and act autonomously. &#8211; take robots within the production industry and self-driving cars as an example. AI machine learning algorithms are also already overtaking customer service jobs with the extended implementation of chatbots. It is safe to conclude that artificial intelligence will probably cut the need for human employees across many different industries in the future. But can AI replace humans in creative jobs, and will web development become obsolete because of it?</span></p>
<p><span data-preserver-spaces="true">The answer is &#8211; No; AI will not replace web developers, at least not in the near future. While artificial intelligence systems might overtake smaller web design jobs, they will also create new job opportunities for people capable of managing such systems and utilizing AI machine learning algorithms in web design. This cycle in which jobs are redefined is easy to notice throughout human evolution. </span></p>
<h3><span data-preserver-spaces="true">How can AI help web developers in the future?</span></h3>
<p><span data-preserver-spaces="true">While some people see web development dying in the future because of artificial intelligence machine learning technology, we believe that it will only help professionals improve the quality of their work. Actually, web developers are already building automation tools that help them create better websites, social media apps, and more. Let&#8217;s see how the artificial intelligence paradigm shift can change the web development industry:</span><span data-preserver-spaces="true"> </span></p>
<h5>AI can make coding quicker</h5>
<p><span data-preserver-spaces="true">Artificial intelligence can help developers code faster by identifying coding patterns and suggesting solutions. This technology can also help developers find errors in their code more quickly, saving time and preventing errors from happening in the first place. That is excellent news for both business owners and web developers. Clients will get their web projects completed faster, while web developers won&#8217;t have to face the stress of finding errors and writing repetitive lines of code when working under time pressure.</span></p>
<h5>AI can improve User Experience</h5>
<p><span data-preserver-spaces="true">Web developers can utilize artificial intelligence technology in various ways to improve the user experience on their websites. For example, one of the latest </span><a class="editor-rtfLink" href="/latest-ui-ux-design-trends" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span data-preserver-spaces="true">UX trends</span></a><span data-preserver-spaces="true"> is using AI machine learning technology for analyzing data from a website and then creating a bot that can automatically fill in forms on the website, which saves users time. AI can also help website owners present more personalized content for website visitors based on their past interactions with the site and similar.</span></p>
<h5>AI can make Quality Assurance easier</h5>
<p><span data-preserver-spaces="true">Artificial intelligence can help web developers ensure that the quality of a website meets the expectations of the end users. It can help them save time and improve the accuracy of results by automating both technical and non-technical tasks. </span></p>
<h5>AI can help you analyze User Behaviour</h5>
<p><span data-preserver-spaces="true">AI will also allow website owners and web developers to analyze traffic data more efficiently and better understand what needs to be changed to improve conversion rates across landing pages. Digital marketing agencies will have much better insight into customers&#8217; preferences, allowing them to deliver the right message at the right time for each potential buyer.</span></p>
<p><span data-preserver-spaces="true">As you can see, web developers will be able to use artificial intelligence in the future to deliver better-performing websites to their clients. That&#8217;s why, instead of fearing inevitable changes in the web development industry, we advise you to find ways to incorporate new technologies into your work. </span></p>
<h2 id="final"><span data-preserver-spaces="true">Final thoughts</span></h2>
<p><span data-preserver-spaces="true">So, will web development become obsolete? No. It will definitely change, but the demand for web developers will keep rising in the following years. As an experienced </span><a class="editor-rtfLink" href="/web-development-agency-chicago" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span data-preserver-spaces="true">web development agency in Chicago</span></a><span data-preserver-spaces="true">, we can assure you that there is nothing to fear if you keep learning about new technology and obtaining the necessary skills to help businesses grow in the digital environment. If you believe this article helped you with that, there are other interesting topics you can explore on our blog.</span></p>','https://alphaefficiency.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/11/webdevobsolete1-1024x768.png',NULL,'[]','[354,308]','2022-11-25T12:36:15','2022-11-25T12:36:15',1897,5,3),
