  (18602,'/is-web-development-career-stressful','is-web-development-career-stressful','post','blog','Is a web development career stressful?','Is a web development career stressful? - Alpha Efficiency.™','If you are looking for a web development career, you might be wondering how stressful a web development job really is.','https://alphaefficiency.com/is-web-development-career-stressful',1,'Whether you are just about to start a career in web development or looking for an opportunity to change your profession, you might be wondering how stressful a web development job really is. Considering the health consequences a prolonged exposure to stress can cause, this is a totally legitimate question. I&#8217;ve been running a web &hellip; Continued','<p><span data-preserver-spaces="true">Whether you are just about to start a career in web development or looking for an opportunity to change your profession, you might be wondering how stressful a web development job really is.</span></p>
<p><span data-preserver-spaces="true">Considering the health consequences a prolonged exposure to stress can cause, this is a totally legitimate question.</span></p>
<p><span data-preserver-spaces="true">I&#8217;ve been running a web development agency in Chicago for over a decade. Managing over 20 employees, I&#8217;ve seen people quit, and people thrive under pressure.</span></p>
