</ul>
<img src="https://alphaefficiency.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/ai-tools-for-digital-marketing.png" alt="AI tools for digital marketing illustration" width="800" height="600" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
<h2 id="what-is-an-ai-tool"><span data-preserver-spaces="true">What Is an AI-Powered Marketing Tool?</span></h2>
<p><span data-preserver-spaces="true">AI marketing tools are software powered by artificial intelligence and machine learning models. These tools can make decisions in a similar way humans do, but much faster. Many companies use AI marketing tools to automate complex tasks, such as analyzing customer data, predicting future trends, conducting quality keyword research, and much more. </span></p>
<p><span data-preserver-spaces="true">While many people worry that AI tools will replace humans in the digital marketing industry, we prefer to look at the bright side &#8211; they&#8217;ll help your employees improve the quality of their work and allow them to focus on critical tasks. Before we start exploring the best AI marketing tools for digital marketing, you should gain a clear understanding of how they can help your company. So let&#8217;s jump to the next section of this article.</span></p>
<h2 id="benefits"><span data-preserver-spaces="true">What Are the Benefits of AI-Powered Marketing Tools?</span></h2>
<p><span data-preserver-spaces="true">When operating a business in a competitive industry, it takes lots of effort to convince potential clients to choose your products or services. And once your business starts growing, you&#8217;ll have to spend lots of time and energy analyzing extensive data in order to provide the best possible experience to everyone who interacts with your company. During this long road, AI marketing tools can prove beneficial for your business in many different ways. Some of the most common include:</span></p>
<ul>
<li><strong><span data-preserver-spaces="true">Marketing automation tools will help you make quality decisions faster: </span></strong><span data-preserver-spaces="true">With the help of artificial intelligence and machine learning models, you can automate the process of making data-driven decisions. And data is essential for making high-quality in every aspect of digital marketing. AI marketing automation tools can make your social media management and email marketing efforts more accurate.</span></li>
<li><strong><span data-preserver-spaces="true">AI marketing tools will save you time and money: </span></strong><span data-preserver-spaces="true">Although you&#8217;ll have to dedicate a part of your budget to buy the best AI tools for digital marketing, these tools will save you a lot of time and money once you start using them. Artificial intelligence can perform some tasks with the same accuracy as your employees would do but much faster. And AI tools can help your in-house team automate boring tasks and focus on the most important ones. Not to mention that it will help you minimize the number of mistakes your employees make.</span></li>
<li><strong><span data-preserver-spaces="true">AI marketing tools help you adapt to each customer: </span></strong><span data-preserver-spaces="true">By analyzing your customer data, some AI tools can help you predict customer behaviors to provide everyone with the content they&#8217;ll enjoy the most. It will allow you to accurately recommend blog posts, products, or services. That will positively impact the user experience and help you build positive associations around your brand.</span></li>
</ul>
<h2 id="ai-marketing-solutions"><span data-preserver-spaces="true">Types of AI Marketing Solutions</span></h2>
<p><span data-preserver-spaces="true">Digital marketing is a wide field that includes content creation, SEO, PPC advertising, email marketing, web design, customer management, social media management, and much more&#8230; Many obstacles can arise on the path to success, especially if you don&#8217;t have dedicated teams to cover each of these aspects. But when faced with tight deadlines, even large companies sometimes go through tough challenges. Fortunately, the best AI tools for digital marketing we&#8217;ll cover in this article can help you find solutions to all of these problems. Here are just some of the ways AI tools can help you and your company improve the work-quality:</span></p>
<h4>Using AI marketing tools to enhance the content creation process:</h4>
<p><span data-preserver-spaces="true">Regularly creating high-quality content is an aspect of digital marketing you can&#8217;t afford to skip. But it can be challenging to keep up with a tight schedule, especially when you run out of ideas. Luckily, there are AI tools that can help you overcome the creativity block or generate better content ideas for your website and social media platforms.</span></p>
<h4>Creating powerful website design with the help of artificial intelligence:</h4>
<p><span data-preserver-spaces="true">AI tools can help you create beautiful graphics for your website and digital marketing campaigns but also help you with </span><a class="editor-rtfLink" href="/qa-design-process" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span data-preserver-spaces="true">design QA</span></a><span data-preserver-spaces="true">. This way, you&#8217;ll ensure that your website is ready to perform at the highest level.</span></p>
<h4>Automating email marketing efforts with AI tools:</h4>
<p><span data-preserver-spaces="true">Some of the best AI tools for digital marketing can help you improve the quality of the emails you send to your audience. Writing emails over and over again might feel repetitive after some time. That&#8217;s why many businesses already use AI marketing tools to research, write and test the quality of their emails.</span></p>
<h4>Creating world-class customer service with chatbots:</h4>
<p><span data-preserver-spaces="true">If you didn&#8217;t have a chance to interact with modern chatbots, you might be surprised by how much they&#8217;ve evolved in recent years. Combining them with live support will allow you to craft an amazing customer service experience for your visitors. Help will be available to your customers 24/7, and they&#8217;ll never feel ignored again.</span></p>
<h4>Executing a perfect SEO strategy with AI marketing tools:</h4>
<p><span data-preserver-spaces="true">SEO tools powered by artificial intelligence can help you with various tasks related to search engine optimization. From keyword research to code optimization, you&#8217;ll find various SEO solutions among these best AI tools for digital marketing.</span></p>
<h2 id="best-ai-tools"><span data-preserver-spaces="true">10 Best AI tools that will boost your digital marketing success</span></h2>
<p><span data-preserver-spaces="true">Now that we understand how artificial intelligence and machine learning are reshaping digital marketing, it&#8217;s time to explore some of the best AI tools for digital marketing. But before we start, please note that numbers are there just for readability purposes. This is not a rank list, and experts from our digital marketing agency advise you to check each of these AI tools to find the one that best suits your needs:</span></p>

<h3 id="semrush"><span data-preserver-spaces="true">SEMrush</span></h3>
<img src="https://alphaefficiency.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/semrush-logo.png" alt="Logo of SEMrush, one of the best AI tools for digital marketing when it comes to SEO and content creation" width="800" height="205" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
<p><strong><span data-preserver-spaces="true">Price: </span></strong><span data-preserver-spaces="true">$119 per month for a Pro Plan/ $229 per month for a Guru Plan/ $499 per month for a Business Plan</span></p>
<p><strong><span data-preserver-spaces="true">Features:</span></strong></p>
<ul>
<li><span data-preserver-spaces="true">A wide range of SEO tools</span></li>
<li><span data-preserver-spaces="true">Content marketing and content optimization tools</span></li>
<li><span data-preserver-spaces="true">Market research and competitor monitoring tools</span></li>
<li><span data-preserver-spaces="true">PPC advertising and website monetization tools</span></li>
<li><span data-preserver-spaces="true">Social media management tools</span></li>
</ul>
<p><span data-preserver-spaces="true">If you are looking for an all-around SEO tool with advanced features, not many can compete with SEMrush. This tool can help you with just any aspect of your SEO campaigns &#8211; from conducting <a href="/7-essential-steps-to-profitable-keyword-research-service-that-drive-results">profitable keyword research</a> to link building. But it also shines in content marketing, social media marketing, analytics, pay-per-click advertising, and much more. But one of the most powerful features SEMrush provides is a position tracking tool. You can choose a keyword and quickly check how your website ranks for it compared to your rivals. </span></p>
<p><span data-preserver-spaces="true">Another area where SEMrush can be a real game-changer for your company is content marketing. Its toolkit will provide valuable help during each step of creating and delivering content to the right audience at the right time. It can help you find exciting topics, write SEO-friendly articles, and create content marketing plans that deliver results.</span></p>
<p><span data-preserver-spaces="true">It also offers excellent collaboration tools for teams of any size. So it&#8217;s no surprise that many famous brands like Apple and Amazon trust SEMrush for their digital marketing needs. We at </span><a class="editor-rtfLink" href="/seo-agency-chicago" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span data-preserver-spaces="true">SEO marketing Chicago</span></a><span data-preserver-spaces="true"> agency have been successfully using this tool for years &#8211; and yes, it helped us realize that you might be interested in learning more about the best AI tools for digital marketing, so we wrote this article. </span></p>
<p><span data-preserver-spaces="true">And thanks to an extensive knowledge library, you&#8217;ll be able to quickly get a good grasp on one of the best AI tools for digital marketing.</span></p>
<h3 id="Grammarly"><span data-preserver-spaces="true">Grammarly</span></h3>
<img src="https://alphaefficiency.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/grammarly-logo.png" alt="Grammarly logo. Grammarly is one of the best AI tools for digital marketing when it comes to content writing" width="800" height="205" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
<p><strong><span data-preserver-spaces="true">Price: </span></strong><span data-preserver-spaces="true">Basic Plan is free/ Premium Plan starts at $12/ Business Plan starts at $15/</span></p>
<p><strong><span data-preserver-spaces="true">Features: </span></strong></p>
<ul>
<li><span data-preserver-spaces="true">Grammar and spelling checker</span></li>
<li><span data-preserver-spaces="true">Plagiarism checker</span></li>
<li><span data-preserver-spaces="true">Tone detection and suggestions</span></li>
<li><span data-preserver-spaces="true">Clarity detection</span></li>
<li><span data-preserver-spaces="true">Analyzes your texts to predict how engaging they&#8217;ll be to your target audience</span></li>
<li><span data-preserver-spaces="true">Advanced writing suggestions that will help you meet a specific style</span></li>
<li><span data-preserver-spaces="true">Chrome extension</span></li>
</ul>
<p><span data-preserver-spaces="true">If you want to ensure your written content is polished and ready to be served to your target audience, you can make this process significantly easier with Grammarly. With a wide range of features, you&#8217;ll be able to fix any grammatical errors and ensure you&#8217;re using a style and tone that will engage your readers. Thanks to this AI tool, you won&#8217;t have to worry about redundancies and inconsistencies. It allows you to focus on gathering fresh ideas instead.</span></p>
<p><span data-preserver-spaces="true">Premium and Business plans bring even more options. You&#8217;ll be able to utilize this AI tool to rewrite sentences for clarity, fluency, and increased engagement. Grammarly can also help you deliver your messages in the desired way. Whether you want to sound friendly, diplomatic, confident, etc. &#8211; artificial intelligence will suggest changes in real time so you can quickly adjust your text.</span></p>
<p><span data-preserver-spaces="true">What we really like about this AI tool is that it doesn&#8217;t automatically replace your words &#8211; Grammarly provides you with suggestions you can then either accept or completely ignore. And when you&#8217;re done writing, you can check an overall score to make sure it&#8217;s ready for publishing.</span></p>
<p><span data-preserver-spaces="true">And if you want to avoid any potential SEO penalty due to plagiarized sentences, this AI tool is great at plagiarism detection. It&#8217;s also worth noting that there is a Chrome extension for Grammarly, so you won&#8217;t need to bother with repetitive copy/paste actions. This AI tool can help you sharpen your content writing skills anywhere on the web. </span><span data-preserver-spaces="true">This powerful AI tool helped Alpha Efficiency&#8217;s content writers and editors speed up their work while still improving content quality. </span></p>
<h3 id="jasper-ai"><span data-preserver-spaces="true">Jasper.ai</span></h3>
<img src="https://alphaefficiency.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/jasper.ai-logo.png" alt="Jasper.ai logo" width="800" height="205" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
<p><strong><span data-preserver-spaces="true">Price: </span></strong><span data-preserver-spaces="true">$40 for Starter / $82 for Boss Mode/ Custom plans for businesses</span></p>
<p><strong><span data-preserver-spaces="true">Features:</span></strong></p>
<ul>
<li><span data-preserver-spaces="true">Over 50 templates for writing a copy</span></li>
<li><span data-preserver-spaces="true">Ability to write both long and short content forms</span></li>
<li><span data-preserver-spaces="true">Google Docs style editor</span></li>
<li><span data-preserver-spaces="true">Art Generator</span></li>
<li><span data-preserver-spaces="true">29+ languages supported</span></li>
<li><span data-preserver-spaces="true">Chrome extension available</span></li>
<li><span data-preserver-spaces="true">Integration with Surfer SEO</span></li>
<li><span data-preserver-spaces="true">AI assistant you can chat with in order to improve content quality</span></li>
<li><span data-preserver-spaces="true">Live Chat support</span></li>
</ul>
<p><span data-preserver-spaces="true">Jasper is an AI marketing tool that can help you create better copy, emails, blog articles, social media posts, and more. It uses GPT-3 model to write texts that sound like humans wrote them. With various templates such as AIDA, PAS, and Features To Benefits, it can help you overcome writer&#8217;s block and successfully promote your products or services online. Jasper also comes in handy for writing product descriptions on eCommerce websites. </span></p>
<p><span data-preserver-spaces="true">If your content creation process lacks speed, then this AI tool might be the perfect choice for you. It can help you generate fresh ideas and polish your content to perfection.</span></p>
<h3 id="mobilemonkey"><span data-preserver-spaces="true">MobileMonkey</span></h3>
<img src="https://alphaefficiency.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/mobilemonkey-logo.png" alt="MobileMonkey logo" width="800" height="205" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
<p><strong><span data-preserver-spaces="true">Price: </span></strong><span data-preserver-spaces="true">Custom quote</span></p>
<p><strong><span data-preserver-spaces="true">Features:</span></strong></p>
<ul>
<li><span data-preserver-spaces="true">Tools for collecting website visitors&#8217; info</span></li>
<li><span data-preserver-spaces="true">Auto-message website visitors</span></li>
<li><span data-preserver-spaces="true">Email delivery and multiple senders tools</span></li>
<li><span data-preserver-spaces="true">SMS marketing tools</span></li>
<li><span data-preserver-spaces="true">Instagram and Facebook DM automation funnels</span></li>
<li><span data-preserver-spaces="true">Sends alerts to your team when a qualified lead expresses interest in making a purchase</span></li>
<li><span data-preserver-spaces="true">Advanced attribution and analytics tools</span></li>
</ul>
<p><span data-preserver-spaces="true">With MobileMonkey, you can automate various aspects of messaging and customer engagement on social media platforms like Facebook and WhatsApp. This AI tool allows you to create chatbots that provide personalized responses to your potential customers. And if you&#8217;d like to send different messages to specific demographics, MobileMonkey allows you to do it in a simple way.</span></p>
<p><span data-preserver-spaces="true">You&#8217;ll also get a real-time multiplatform chatbot that is easily integrable with email marketing and CRM systems. This way, you can enhance any of your digital marketing campaigns with accurate targeting and more engaging conversations with your potential customers. We found the MobileMonkey AI tool to be especially useful for B2C businesses.</span></p>
<h3 id="smartwriter-ai"><span data-preserver-spaces="true">Smartwriter.ai</span></h3>
<img src="https://alphaefficiency.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/smartwriter.ai-logo.png" alt="Smartwriter.ai logo" width="800" height="205" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
<p><strong><span data-preserver-spaces="true">Price: </span></strong><span data-preserver-spaces="true">$49 per month for Basic/ $124 per month for Popular/ $299 for Pro</span></p>
<p><strong><span data-preserver-spaces="true">Features:</span></strong></p>
<ul>
<li><span data-preserver-spaces="true">Generate personalized cold emails from scratch</span></li>
<li><span data-preserver-spaces="true">High-quality subject lines generation</span></li>
<li><span data-preserver-spaces="true">Automatically create outreach messages based on prospects&#8217; online data to boost click rates</span></li>
<li><span data-preserver-spaces="true">LinkedIn Chrome extension</span></li>
<li><span data-preserver-spaces="true">Personalized LinkedIn outreach</span></li>
<li><span data-preserver-spaces="true">Create knowledge graphs about your leads</span></li>
<li><span data-preserver-spaces="true">Automated SEO backlink outreach</span></li>
</ul>
<p><span data-preserver-spaces="true">This is definitely one of the best AI digital marketing tools that can help you with personalized email and LinkedIn outreach. It analyses your prospects&#8217; online data to create powerful subject lines and pitch your products in a way that is most likely to drive sales.</span></p>
<p><span data-preserver-spaces="true">And if you want to build backlinks but didn&#8217;t have much luck with reaching out to owners of authoritative websites within your industry, Smartwriter.ai might help you change the outcome. This AI tool can quickly analyze entire blogs and craft compelling outreach messages.</span></p>
<p><span data-preserver-spaces="true">It&#8217;s also very easy to integrate Smartwriter.ai with other tools and platforms, which makes it a perfect addition to your digital marketing toolkit.</span></p>
<h3 id="manychat"><span data-preserver-spaces="true">ManyChat</span></h3>
<img src="https://alphaefficiency.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/manychat-logo.png" alt="manychat logo" width="800" height="205" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
<p><strong><span data-preserver-spaces="true">Price:</span></strong><span data-preserver-spaces="true"> Pro plan costs $15 per month, but there is also a free plan.</span></p>
<p><strong><span data-preserver-spaces="true">Features:</span></strong></p>
<ul>
<li><span data-preserver-spaces="true">Automatically book appointments</span></li>
<li><span data-preserver-spaces="true">Send order updates</span></li>
<li><span data-preserver-spaces="true">Share promotions</span></li>
<li><span data-preserver-spaces="true">Answer your customers&#8217; questions</span></li>
<li><span data-preserver-spaces="true">Collect feedback and reviews</span></li>
<li><span data-preserver-spaces="true">Facebook Messanger, Instagram, WhatsApp, SMS support</span></li>
<li><span data-preserver-spaces="true">Easy to integrate with other digital marketing tools</span></li>
</ul>
<p><span data-preserver-spaces="true">One of the best AI chatbots you can use to drive sales, engage customers through personalized conversations, and generate high-quality leads. While the main focus is on Facebook Messenger, you can use ManyChat with Instagram, WhatsApp, and SMS too.</span></p>
<p><span data-preserver-spaces="true">It&#8217;s possible to set up this AI tool within 20 minutes, even if you don&#8217;t possess any coding knowledge. You can combine ManyChat with Shopify, Google Sheets, MailChimp, and many other tools you are already using.</span></p>
<h3 id="writerzen"><span data-preserver-spaces="true">WriterZen</span></h3>
<img src="https://alphaefficiency.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/writerzen-logo.png" alt="WriterZen logo" width="800" height="205" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
<p><strong><span data-preserver-spaces="true">Price: </span></strong><span data-preserver-spaces="true">$29 per month for Basic/ $41 per month for Standard/ $69 per month for Advanced</span></p>
<p><strong><span data-preserver-spaces="true">Features: </span></strong></p>
<ul>
<li><span data-preserver-spaces="true">Topic Discovery</span></li>
<li><span data-preserver-spaces="true">Keyword Explorer</span></li>
<li><span data-preserver-spaces="true">Keyword Insights</span></li>
<li><span data-preserver-spaces="true">Keyword Importer</span></li>
<li><span data-preserver-spaces="true">It provides you with Google&#8217;s FAQ and questions people posted about a specific topic in popular communities such as Reddit</span></li>
<li><span data-preserver-spaces="true">A list of competitors for a specific keyword and deep insights into their articles</span></li>
<li><span data-preserver-spaces="true">AI-powered content brief creation</span></li>
<li><span data-preserver-spaces="true">AI writing assistant</span></li>
</ul>
<p><span data-preserver-spaces="true">As one of the best AI tools for digital marketing, WriterZen can help you with various SEO content creation tasks. Constantly generating high-quality ideas for your articles can be a daunting task, but with this AI tool, you can save a lot of time and energy. Once you enter a focus keyword, WriterZen will help you find interesting topics you can write about. But we&#8217;ve just scratched the surface of the wide array of opportunities this AI tool provides.</span></p>
<p><span data-preserver-spaces="true">By showing you important keyword metrics, it will help you find valuable keywords to target with your article. Besides identifying <a href="/keyword-search-volume-explained">keyword search volume</a>, you&#8217;ll also be able to see how many times your competitors included it in their headlines and much more. And in the Keyword Cluster section, you&#8217;ll be able to find all the related keywords you can include in your article in order to give it the best possible chances of ranking high in search engine results pages.</span></p>
<p><span data-preserver-spaces="true">And once you set up the desired word count and the number of paragraphs, images, and headings &#8211; your writers will get a chance to improve their work quality with an AI assistant. When they&#8217;re done writing, you can use a plagiarism check tool to avoid any potential SEO penalty. </span></p>
<h3 id="deep-art-effects"><span data-preserver-spaces="true">Deep Art Effects</span></h3>
<img src="https://alphaefficiency.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/Deep-Art-Effects-logo.png" alt="Deep Art Effects logo" width="800" height="205" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
<p><strong><span data-preserver-spaces="true">Price: </span></strong><span data-preserver-spaces="true">$9.90 for a one-month subscription/ $25 for a three-month subscription/ $80 for a one-year subscription/ $129 for a one-time purchase</span></p>
<p><strong><span data-preserver-spaces="true">Features:</span></strong></p>
