  (18749,'/using-canva-for-website-design','using-canva-for-website-design','post','blog','All you need to know about using Canva for website design','All you need to know about using Canva - Alpha Efficiency','Using Canva for website design is a great way to impress visitors and help your business stand out online. In this article, I''ll show you how to do it.','https://alphaefficiency.com/using-canva-for-website-design',1,'If you’ve ever created social media content, presentations, posters, hero images, and other engaging visuals for your business, you’ve probably considered using Canva graphic design tool. However, this company has recently expanded its operations to join the website builder market. The great news is that just by using drag-and-drop tools for editing website templates, you &hellip; Continued','<p><span data-preserver-spaces="true">If you’ve ever created social media content, presentations, posters, hero images, and other engaging visuals for your business, you’ve probably considered using Canva graphic design tool.</span></p>
<p><span data-preserver-spaces="true">However, this company has recently expanded its operations to join the website builder market. The great news is that just by using drag-and-drop tools for editing website templates, you can now create Canva websites without any coding knowledge and without spending a fortune.</span></p>
<p><span data-preserver-spaces="true">But if you’re considering using Canva for website design, it’s important to weigh both the pros and cons of this approach. It is also crucial to understand how it compares to other website design platforms and custom-coded websites.</span></p>
<p><span data-preserver-spaces="true">And if you&#8217;re serious about creating a web design that not only looks great but also drives results,</span> <span data-preserver-spaces="true">don&#8217;t miss out on my</span><strong><span data-preserver-spaces="true"> free mini-course,</span></strong><span data-preserver-spaces="true"> <a href="https://get.alphaefficiency.com/7-days-to-profitable-aeshtetics">7 Days to Profitable Aesthetics</a>. In seven lessons delivered directly to your email inbox, you&#8217;ll learn <strong>hard-to-spot mistakes that will push away your visitors if you don&#8217;t fix them</strong>. You&#8217;ll also master <strong>psychology-based web design triggers</strong> for increasing conversion rates on any website within any niche.</span></p>
<p><span data-preserver-spaces="true">In this article, I&#8217;ll show you</span><span data-preserver-spaces="true"> the process of using Canva for website design.</span></p>
<p><span data-preserver-spaces="true">You’ll learn:</span></p>
<ul>
<li><span data-preserver-spaces="true">How to create a mobile-friendly Canva website</span></li>
<li>How to use website Canva templates with WordPress</li>
<li>Proven strategies you can use to convert a Canva design to a functional website (without risking costly mistakes).</li>
<li>Whether the Canva website is a professional option for your business and how much you can expect to pay to get the most out of this fresh web design tool.</li>
</ul>
<p>So let’s start!</p>
<img src="https://alphaefficiency.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/using-canva-for-website-design.png" alt="Using Canva for website design" width="800" height="600" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
<h5>Table of Contents:</h5>
<ul>
<li><a href="/#website-creation-process">The Most Effective Approach to Canva Website Creation Process</a>
<ul>
<li><a href="/#template">Find the website template that you like</a></li>
<li><a href="/#brand">Customize website Canva template to match your brand identity</a></li>
<li><a href="/#cta">Add hyperlinks and CTA buttons to drive visitors&#8217; actions</a></li>
