<li><a href="/#publish">Publish your website</a></li>
</ul>
</li>
<li><a href="/#mobile">How to make a Canva website mobile-friendly?</a></li>
<li><a href="/#blog">Can you create a blog with Canva?</a></li>
<li><a href="/#is-canva-good">Is Canva good for website design?</a></li>
<li><a href="/#situations">If you&#8217;re in one of these situations, a Canva website is a perfect solution&#8230;</a></li>
<li><a href="/#costs">How much it costs to create Canva websites?</a></li>
<li><a href="/#is-it-unprofessional">Is it unprofessional to use Canva?</a>
