<h3 id="cta"><img src="https://alphaefficiency.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/canva-pricing.png" alt="Three Canva Pricing Plans" width="800" height="600" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /></h3>
<h2 id="costs"><span data-preserver-spaces="true">How much it costs to create Canva websites?</span></h2>
<p><span data-preserver-spaces="true">If you wonder how much money using Canva for website design costs, there are several factors to include in the equation. Let’s start by analyzing three levels of the Canva pricing plan:</span></p>
<ul>
<li><strong><span data-preserver-spaces="true">Canva Free – </span></strong><span data-preserver-spaces="true">This plan offers more than 250,000 free templates for various purposes – from templates for social media posts to website Canva templates. You’ll also have access to drag-and-drop tools. It is a great way to start your journey and determine whether using Canva for website design can benefit your business. However, there are also many limitations to the free plan. For example, you’ll only have 5GB of cloud storage and lack some useful tools the Canva Pro plan includes. But with this plan, you’ll still be able to design beautiful Canva websites and publish up to five on a free Canva domain.</span></li>
<li><strong><span data-preserver-spaces="true">Canva Pro – </span></strong><span data-preserver-spaces="true">With Canva Pro, you’ll get full access to the creative library containing premium templates, premium stock photos, and other visual elements. You’ll also be able to use tools for branding, removing image backgrounds, resizing designs, and more. Canva Pro offers 1TB cloud storage, 24/7 customer support, and an option to schedule posts to your social media pages on up to 8 platforms. For </span><strong><span data-preserver-spaces="true">$119.99/year, </span></strong><span data-preserver-spaces="true">you can utilize Canva’s full potential when creating website designs. Another important consideration is that you’ll be able to host an unlimited number of websites on Canva’s free domain with a Pro plan.</span></li>
<li><strong><span data-preserver-spaces="true">Canva for Teams – </span></strong><span data-preserver-spaces="true">A great option if you have a web design team. Besides all the features the previous two plans contain, you’ll also get the necessary tools to enhance collaboration between team members and establish a smooth workflow. It costs </span><strong><span data-preserver-spaces="true">$149.90/year for the first five members</span></strong><span data-preserver-spaces="true">, but it is fully scalable to meet the size of your web design team.</span></li>
</ul>
<h3>The domain name and Hosting Costs</h3>
<p><span data-preserver-spaces="true">As mentioned before, there are </span><strong><span data-preserver-spaces="true">three options when it comes to the domain name</span></strong><span data-preserver-spaces="true">. You can use either Canva’s free domain, purchase a domain through Canva or purchase one from a third-party service provider. We advise you to avoid using a free domain and instead buy a professional-looking domain for your website. With Canva, you can purchase a domain name for around $19 to $25 per year. If you already have a domain name, you can connect it to your Canva website. But keep in mind that in order to do so, you’ll need to be subscribed to the Canva Pro plan.</span></p>
<p><span data-preserver-spaces="true">Also, if you want to boost your </span><a class="editor-rtfLink" href="/average-pagespeed-score" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span data-preserver-spaces="true">average PageSpeed score</span></a><span data-preserver-spaces="true"> and create a better user experience for your visitors, you’ll need to find an adequate hosting solution. Depending on the size of your website, it might cost you from $3 to $250+ per month. But considering that Canva websites are usually not meant to be big, you won’t have to spend a fortune to buy a reliable hosting plan.</span></p>
<h3>Using Canva for Website Design – The Total Price?</h3>
<p><span data-preserver-spaces="true">So what is the total cost for a Canva website? Theoretically, you can create one for free. Not many other page builders offer this deal to their users. But unless you are using Canva for practicing web design, we advise you to at least buy a domain name and Canva Pro plan. This way, your potential customers will be able to easily find your business online, and you’ll also have much more templates and design elements to choose from during the website creation process. When all sums up, for just around $140 annual cost, you can have your own professional-looking Canva website you can use as an important asset in your digital marketing strategy.</span></p>
