<p><span data-preserver-spaces="true">As far as our </span><a class="editor-rtfLink" href="/web-design-agency-chicago" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span data-preserver-spaces="true">web design agency in Chicago</span></a><span data-preserver-spaces="true"> is concerned, using Canva as your web design tool is not unprofessional, especially if you’re creating a Canva website with a specific goal in mind or as a piece of your content marketing strategy. In cases where you don’t want to risk losing potential customers’ focus from the desired action due to your main website’s complexity, one-page Canva websites can save the day. These will allow you to provide visitors with just the right amount of information and control their behavior in a way that will secure more conversions.</span></p>
