  (20691,'/how-long-does-it-take-to-design-a-landing-page','how-long-does-it-take-to-design-a-landing-page','post','blog','How Long Does It Take To Design A Landing Page?','How Long Does It Take To Design A Landing Page? | Alpha Efficiency','How long does it take to design a landing page that will impress your audience and drive conversions? Discover the answer in this article.','https://alphaefficiency.com/how-long-does-it-take-to-design-a-landing-page',1,'It happened… Your boss gave you a dreaded assignment. He’s actually asking you to build a landing page from scratch and wants to know when you’ll finish it. But by knowing your boss really well, you know he won’t settle for a cheap Theme Forest template. This task is going to take more. It will &hellip; Continued','<p>It happened…</p>
