<li><strong><span data-preserver-spaces="true">Credibility: </span></strong><span data-preserver-spaces="true">Patients associate the top results on Google with trustworthiness and credibility. By earning your spot on the first page, you enhance your online reputation.</span></li>
<li><strong><span data-preserver-spaces="true">Cost-effective patient acquisition: </span></strong><span data-preserver-spaces="true">SEO is an effective way to reduce patient acquisition costs. Once you build trust with search engines and start attracting organic traffic for valuable keywords, it will become much cheaper for you to acquire new patients.</span></li>
</ul>
<p><span data-preserver-spaces="true">However, to reap these benefits, you need to pay attention to key areas of SEO for doctors, including:</span></p>
<ul>
