<li><strong><span data-preserver-spaces="true">On-Page SEO: </span></strong><span data-preserver-spaces="true">All the actions you take on your website that influence its rankings in search engines like Google.</span></li>
<li><strong><span data-preserver-spaces="true">Off-Page SEO: </span></strong><span data-preserver-spaces="true">Link-building and other actions you take outside your site to improve its authority and ranking.</span></li>
<li><strong><span data-preserver-spaces="true">Technical SEO: </span></strong><span data-preserver-spaces="true">Ensuring your website is easily crawlable and indexable by search engine bots and loads quickly for a seamless user experience.</span></li>
</ul>
<p><span data-preserver-spaces="true">You can take the DIY route, but if you have no experience with search engine optimization, you&#8217;ll need to go through the trial and error process. My </span><a class="editor-rtfLink" href="/seo-agency-chicago" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span data-preserver-spaces="true">SEO agency in Chicago</span></a><span data-preserver-spaces="true"> can help ensure all your efforts drive tangible results and your website starts ranking high in SERPs as quickly as possible.</span></p>
<h4><span data-preserver-spaces="true">Local SEO For Doctors Will Position Your Healthcare Practice As a Go-To Choice</span></h4>
<p><span data-preserver-spaces="true">Local SEO is the magic formula that makes your practice pop up in search results when a potential patient in your vicinity looks up &#8220;doctors near me&#8221; or similar queries. It&#8217;s a highly targeted branch of SEO. And it will help you attract more patients from relevant local searches on Google.</span></p>
<p><span data-preserver-spaces="true">Why should you, as a doctor, pay attention to local SEO? Because local is where your patients are. By ranking high on local search results, you position your practice as the go-to healthcare choice in your community.</span></p>
<p><span data-preserver-spaces="true">Many practices overlook local SEO. That&#8217;s your chance to gain a competitive advantage. It might be your golden opportunity to outshine other local healthcare providers.</span></p>
<p><span data-preserver-spaces="true">Another important consideration is that local searches have high intent, meaning a person will likely take action (like booking an appointment) soon. There&#8217;s a massive potential in local SEO when it comes to patient conversions.</span></p>
