  (21265,'/twitter-ghostwriting','twitter-ghostwriting','post','blog','Twitter Ghostwriting Can Make $10k/mo. These are 5 Insane Benefits.','Twitter Ghostwriting: $10k/mo & 5 Benefits | Alpha Efficiency.™','This article contains my 14 years of experience on Twitter summarized in no-nonsense Twitter ghostwriting advice for companies and individuals alike.','https://alphaefficiency.com/twitter-ghostwriting',1,'Are you looking to get to that next funding round and want to catch the eye of those potential venture capitalists that hang out on Twitter (X)? Or do you simply want to have a much bigger pool of potential clients through an enhanced personal brand? Growing on Twitter (Now X) is absolutely brutal if &hellip; Continued','<p>Are you looking to get to that next funding round and want to catch the eye of those potential venture capitalists that hang out on Twitter (X)? Or do you simply want to have a much bigger pool of potential clients through an enhanced personal brand?</p>
<p>Growing on Twitter (Now X) is absolutely brutal if you don’t know what you’re doing. This article will help you understand what you should be doing in order to grow on Twitter. But better yet, reading through this piece, you will know exactly what to look for in your Twitter ghostwriter and what skills and chops he needs to have in order to help you achieve stellar results with your profile.</p>
<p>Twitter content that works is not an accident. It is a byproduct of observing what is happening on the platform and knowing how to write tweets, build relationships and overall grow your Twitter Account.</p>
<p>Whether you need this to grow your personal brand, get big funding for your business, or simply want to quit your Day Job, read on. This article contains my 14 years of experience on Twitter summarized in no-nonsense Twitter ghostwriting advice for companies and individuals alike.</p>
