<li><strong><span data-preserver-spaces="true">Your team is on the smaller side</span></strong><span data-preserver-spaces="true">: Notion&#8217;s user-friendly interface and simpler organizational structure often resonate well with smaller teams. It makes collaborating on tasks and sharing knowledge less complicated and more streamlined.</span></li>
<li><strong><span data-preserver-spaces="true">Customization is important to you</span></strong><span data-preserver-spaces="true">: If you value the ability to tailor your workspace to suit your specific workflow, Notion is worth considering. Its flexible structure enables you to heavily customize your workspace, which can be particularly useful if you have unique or unconventional processes.</span></li>
