  (21497,'/landing-page-conversion-rates','landing-page-conversion-rates','post','blog','4 Mistakes That Hurt Landing Page Conversion Rates','4 Mistakes That Hurt Landing Page Conversion Rates | Alpha Efficiency.™','Discover the average landing page conversion rates within your industry and how to exceed them with 6 simple tips.','https://alphaefficiency.com/landing-page-conversion-rates',1,'Are you wondering how your landing pages are performing compared to the competition? You and your team spent days crafting a cool design, but it feels like site visitors are not following your calls to action. Is this because your landing page is missing some crucial elements? Or is everything just fine, and you&#8217;re worried &hellip; Continued','<p><span data-preserver-spaces="true">Are you wondering how your landing pages are performing compared to the competition? You and your team spent days crafting a cool design, but it feels like site visitors are not following your calls to action. </span></p>
<p><span data-preserver-spaces="true">Is this because your landing page is missing some crucial elements? Or is everything just fine, and you&#8217;re worried without any reason?</span></p>
<p><span data-preserver-spaces="true">In most cases, you&#8217;ll need to keep optimizing your landing pages upon launching in order to make them high-converting. But you don&#8217;t want to spend days fixing what&#8217;s not broken. Sometimes your landing pages are crushing it without you even realizing that.</span></p>
<p><span data-preserver-spaces="true">Understanding <strong>the average landing page conversion rates across your industry</strong> is a good starting point. It will help you evaluate the quality of your current design and messaging </span><span data-preserver-spaces="true">so you can then improve those and drive more leads. </span></p>
<p>In this article, I&#8217;ll show you why monitoring your landing page conversion rates is vital, how to calculate these, and how you currently compare others within your industry. But you&#8217;ll also learn to identify potential problems in your landing page designs and fix them. This will allow you to finally exceed the average landing page conversion rates and <strong>unlock the path to profit</strong>.</p>
