  (21634,'/ga4-engagement-rate','ga4-engagement-rate','post','blog','The Best Ways To Use GA4 Engagement Rate As A Marketer','The Best Ways To Use GA4 Engagement Rate As A Marketer - Alpha Efficiency','Learn effective ways to use GA4 engagement rate as a marketer, so you can earn the team''s trust and boost your career.','https://alphaefficiency.com/ga4-engagement-rate',1,'If you&#8217;re an ambitious marketer, the shift from Universal Analytics to Google Analytics 4 has probably caught you by surprise. Where&#8217;s the bounce rate? Why is the focus on the GA4 engagement rate now? Many questions need answers. The disorientation caused by all these new metrics and the confusing interface affect the performance of your &hellip; Continued','<p><span data-preserver-spaces="true">If you&#8217;re an ambitious marketer, the shift from Universal Analytics to Google Analytics 4 has probably caught you by surprise. Where&#8217;s the bounce rate? Why is the focus on the GA4 engagement rate now? Many questions need answers.</span></p>
