</ul>
</li>
<li class="ql-indent-1"><span data-preserver-spaces="true">2 Agency or Freelancer Guests</span></li>
</ul>
</li>
<li><strong><span data-preserver-spaces="true">Core ($19/mo per seat, billed yearly) &#8211; </span></strong><span data-preserver-spaces="true">This plan is ideal if you work in a small team that wants greater code control.</span></li>
