</ul>
</li>
<li><strong><span data-preserver-spaces="true">Growth ($49/mo per seat, billed yearly) &#8211; </span></strong><span data-preserver-spaces="true">It&#8217;s ideal for expanding teams desiring unlimited sites and advanced permissions.</span></li>
