<p><span data-preserver-spaces="true">As a </span><a class="editor-rtfLink" href="/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span data-preserver-spaces="true">digital marketing agency</span></a><span data-preserver-spaces="true"> owner, I&#8217;ve witnessed many small business owners wrestle with the changes brought by GA4. Many relied on the bounce rate metric in Universal Analytics and now find it challenging to adapt.</span></p>
