<p><span data-preserver-spaces="true">This course is a concise, 2-hour deep dive into the world of UX website design. It&#8217;s crafted to help beginners understand and implement fundamental UX design principles. Chris Nodder, a respected figure in the UX field, deftly guides you through essential topics.</span></p>
<p><span data-preserver-spaces="true">You&#8217;ll learn how to use graphics effectively, when to opt for interactive media over static elements, and what constitutes quality </span><a class="editor-rtfLink" href="/content-in-ux-design" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span data-preserver-spaces="true">content in UX design</span></a><span data-preserver-spaces="true">. Furthermore, the course provides insight into site navigation, layouts, and more.</span></p>
