</ul>
<h3 id="springboard"><span data-preserver-spaces="true">Springboard&#8217;s UI/UX Design Bootcamp</span></h3>
<p><a class="editor-rtfLink" href="https://www.springboard.com/courses/ui-ux-design-career-track/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span data-preserver-spaces="true">Springboard&#8217;s UI/UX Design Bootcamp</span></a><span data-preserver-spaces="true"> is an immersive and comprehensive program that promises to transform you from a beginner to a job-ready designer in 9 months. This bootcamp stands out due to its student-centric approach, offering 1-on-1 mentor support, career counseling, student advisor assistance, and a platform for community collaboration.</span></p>
<p><span data-preserver-spaces="true">The course begins by introducing you to the fundamentals of UI and UX design tools, setting a solid base for your learning journey. It then gradually progresses into more in-depth aspects of UX design. From conducting UX research to ideation, sketching, wireframing, prototyping, creating information architecture, and more &#8211; this UI UX design bootcamp covers 24 topics in total (including career support).</span></p>
<p><span data-preserver-spaces="true">It&#8217;s also worth mentioning that this is one of the rare courses that delve into the psychological aspects of design, providing a unique perspective on user behavior and decision-making.</span></p>
