<p><span data-preserver-spaces="true">But do eCommerce platforms like Shopify, BogCommerce, and WooCommerce have an impact on SEO? They absolutely do. That&#8217;s why you should take your time when choosing one to build your online store. My </span><a class="editor-rtfLink" href="/seo-agency-chicago" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span data-preserver-spaces="true">SEO company in Chicago</span></a><span data-preserver-spaces="true"> has faced this dilemma before, so today, I want to help your business by giving you detailed <strong>insight into the top eCommerce platforms for SEO</strong>. After analyzing the eight most SEO-friendly eCommerce platforms, you&#8217;ll be able to choose one that best suits your daily needs and <strong>start ranking higher</strong> in search engines long-term.</span></p>
