  (22655,'/cro-audit','cro-audit','post','blog','CRO Audit Checklist: 10 Steps to Improve Results','CRO Audit: 10 Steps to Improve Results','Explore ten steps for conducting a successful CRO audit and identifying issues that are preventing you from achieving high conversion rates.','https://alphaefficiency.com/cro-audit',1,'One of the toughest situations for a marketer is dealing with low conversion rates on a client&#8217;s website. You&#8217;ve put in the hours to build what you thought was a solid marketing plan, but the results just aren&#8217;t showing. It&#8217;s like knowing you missed a step somewhere but not knowing which one. This can really &hellip; Continued','<p><span data-preserver-spaces="true">One of the toughest situations for a marketer is dealing with low conversion rates on a client&#8217;s website. You&#8217;ve put in the hours to build what you thought was a solid marketing plan, but the results just aren&#8217;t showing. It&#8217;s like knowing you missed a step somewhere but not knowing which one.</span></p>
<p><span data-preserver-spaces="true">This can really start to weigh on you. Doubts begin to creep in. Is it something you did? Or didn&#8217;t do? The pressure builds up, especially when clients are waiting for results. It feels like you&#8217;re stuck in a loop, trying to find that one thing you might have missed.</span></p>
<p><span data-preserver-spaces="true">Most marketers face this hurdle at some point. Conducting a thorough CRO audit has been my go-to strategy whenever I hit a roadblock. This means checking everything from top to bottom to find where the problems are.</span></p>
<p><span data-preserver-spaces="true">At my </span><a class="editor-rtfLink" href="/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span data-preserver-spaces="true">digital marketing agency</span></a><span data-preserver-spaces="true">, we&#8217;ve made it a practice to prepare a CRO audit plan before diving into any project. This approach has been our safety net, giving us the confidence to tackle any challenge head-on.</span></p>
<p><span data-preserver-spaces="true">To make it easier for you, I&#8217;ve put together a 10-step CRO audit checklist. This is a straightforward guide to help you <strong>spot what needs fixing and get those conversions up</strong>.</span></p>
<p><span data-preserver-spaces="true">Using this checklist gives you a clear plan for doing your conversion optimization audit. You&#8217;ll know exactly what to look for and how to fix it in order to increase conversion rates. This means better results for your website and happier clients. So, let&#8217;s dive in and turn those numbers around.</span></p>
<h5><span data-preserver-spaces="true">Table of Contents:</span></h5>
<ul>
