<li><a href="/#steps"><span data-preserver-spaces="true">10-Step CRO Audit Checklist To Maximize Your Profit</span></a>
<ul>
<li><a href="/#goals"><span data-preserver-spaces="true">Start By Establishing Your Conversion Goals</span></a></li>
<li><a href="/#priority-pages"><span data-preserver-spaces="true">Focus On Priority Pages To Boost Conversions Faster</span></a></li>
<li><a href="/#ideal-customer-profile"><span data-preserver-spaces="true">Create an Ideal Customer Profile (ICP) That Will Guide Your CRO Audit</span></a></li>
<li><a href="/#conversion-elements"><span data-preserver-spaces="true">Analyze Conversion Elements On Your Web Pages</span></a></li>
<li><a href="/#trust"><span data-preserver-spaces="true">Closely Examine Trust Building Elements On Your Website</span></a></li>
<li><a href="/#funnel"><span data-preserver-spaces="true">Map Your Conversion Funnel And Analyze How Users Behave At Each Stage</span></a></li>
<li><a href="/#content"><span data-preserver-spaces="true">Evaluate Your Content To See If It Aligns With The Target Audience&#8217;s Needs</span></a></li>
<li><a href="/#feedback"><span data-preserver-spaces="true">Gather Customer Feedback To Get First-Hand Insights</span></a></li>
<li><a href="/#hypothesis"><span data-preserver-spaces="true">Form A Conversion Hypothesis Based On Your Learnings</span></a></li>
<li><a href="/#test"><span data-preserver-spaces="true">A/B Test Various Elements To Improve Conversion Rates Continuously</span></a></li>
</ul>
</li>
