  (22795,'/ada-website-compliance-checklist','ada-website-compliance-checklist','post','blog','ADA Website Compliance Checklist: Create an Amusing Experience For Visitors','ADA Website Compliance Checklist | Alpha Efficiency.™','Explore the ADA website compliance checklist my agency is using to create enjoyable user experiences across clients'' digital assets.','https://alphaefficiency.com/ada-website-compliance-checklist',1,'Website accessibility is your ally &#8211; it helps you exhibit your commitment to social responsibility and promoting inclusivity. On the other hand, neglecting Americans with Disabilities Act (ADA) compliance can end up in someone filing a lawsuit against your website for lack of accessibility or discrimination against people with disabilities. While the ADA still does &hellip; Continued','<p><span data-preserver-spaces="true">Website accessibility is your ally &#8211; it helps you exhibit your commitment to social responsibility and promoting inclusivity. On the other hand, neglecting Americans with Disabilities Act (ADA) compliance can end up in someone filing a lawsuit against your website for lack of accessibility or discrimination against people with disabilities.</span></p>
<p><span data-preserver-spaces="true">While the ADA still does not explicitly mention websites &#8211; creating a gray area for website owners &#8211; no site is exempt from following web accessibility guidelines that adapt to the ADA requirements. If you&#8217;re wondering how to make your website ADA compliant, don&#8217;t panic.</span></p>
