<li><a href="/#simplicity"><span data-preserver-spaces="true">1. Aim For Simplicity &#8211; &#8216;Less Is More&#8217; in Minimalism Graphic Design</span></a></li>
<li><a href="/#functionality"><span data-preserver-spaces="true">2. Prioritize Functionality Over Aesthetics</span></a></li>
