<p>By the end of this guide, you&#8217;ll not only master how to make a hover effect in Figma but also understand which UI elements will benefit the most from it. Once you complete these five steps with my guidance, you&#8217;ll be able to craft Figma hover effects with confidence every time you need them.</p>
