  (26682,'/outdated-web-design-trends','outdated-web-design-trends','post','blog','7 Outdated Web Design Trends That Will Destroy Your Profitability','7 Outdated Web Design Trends That Will Destroy Your Profitability.','Discover 7 outdated web design trends that you must remove from your website before they ruin your online profitability.','https://alphaefficiency.com/outdated-web-design-trends',1,'Are your conversion rates starting to decline? Or are you just unhappy because your digital assets look like they don&#8217;t belong in this decade? Nothing destroys a website&#8217;s profitability as fast as outdated web design trends&#8230; Yet, the fact that some web design trends go out of fashion quickly doesn&#8217;t help. Months pass, and you&#8217;re &hellip; Continued','<p><span data-preserver-spaces="true">Are your conversion rates starting to decline? Or are you just unhappy because your digital assets look like they don&#8217;t belong in this decade? </span><span data-preserver-spaces="true">Nothing destroys a website&#8217;s profitability as fast as outdated web design trends&#8230;</span></p>
<p><span data-preserver-spaces="true">Yet, the fact that some web design trends go out of fashion quickly doesn&#8217;t help.</span></p>
<p><span data-preserver-spaces="true">Months pass, and you&#8217;re already regretting your design choices&#8230;</span></p>
<p><span data-preserver-spaces="true">As the owner of a </span><a class="editor-rtfLink" href="/web-design-agency-chicago" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span data-preserver-spaces="true">web design agency in Chicago</span></a><span data-preserver-spaces="true">, I&#8217;ve been on the frontlines of industry shifts for over 15 years. In this article, I&#8217;d like to share with you</span><span data-preserver-spaces="true"> 7 </span><span data-preserver-spaces="true">trends that were highly popular in previous years, but you must ditch them before it&#8217;s too late.</span></p>
<p><span data-preserver-spaces="true">Even if you don&#8217;t have a website but plan on building it, it&#8217;s crucial to understand which design choices you must avoid.</span></p>
<p><span data-preserver-spaces="true">Don&#8217;t worry; I won&#8217;t focus only on negatives. As we explore these outdated web design trends, I&#8217;ll suggest what you can do instead to <strong>make your digital assets more profitable</strong> and aesthetically pleasing.</span></p>
<h5>Table of Contents:</h5>
<ul>
<li><a href="/#victims"><span data-preserver-spaces="true">How Businesses Become Victims Of Outdated Web Design Trends</span></a></li>
<li><a href="/#consequences"><span data-preserver-spaces="true">What Will Happen If You Don&#8217;t Ditch Outdated Website Design Trends?</span></a></li>
<li><a href="/#7-outdated-trends"><span data-preserver-spaces="true">7 Outdated Web Design Trends In 2024 (And What To Use Instead)</span></a>
<ul>
<li><a href="/#stock-photos"><span data-preserver-spaces="true">Outdated Trend #1: Using Stock Photos Is Seen As Low-Effort</span></a></li>
<li><a href="/#aggressive-popups"><span data-preserver-spaces="true">Outdated Trend #2: Aggressive Popups &#8211; Mobile Users HATE Them</span></a></li>
<li><a href="/#desktop-hamburger"><span data-preserver-spaces="true">Outdated Trend #3: Hamburger Menus On Desktop Versions Is A Web Design Sin In 2024</span></a></li>
