  (26705,'/grid-design-websites','grid-design-websites','post','blog','Grid Design Websites: Practices for Structured and User-Friendly Interfaces','Grid Design: Practices for User-Friendly Interfaces | Alpha Efficiency.™','Explore best practices for crafting grid design websites and arranging your content in a way that leads to excellent user experience.','https://alphaefficiency.com/grid-design-websites',1,'Many designers think of grids as a boring necessity, but they are actually like the secret ingredient that makes web designs look great. Grids help organize content and guide visitors through your design without getting lost, leading them smoothly through your web conversion funnel. While grids have been an essential graphic design element for ages, &hellip; Continued','<p><span data-preserver-spaces="true">Many</span><span data-preserver-spaces="true"> designers think of grids as a boring necessity, but they are actually like the secret ingredient that makes web designs look great.</span><span data-preserver-spaces="true"> Grids help organize content and guide visitors through your design without getting lost, leading them smoothly through your </span><a class="editor-rtfLink" href="/website-conversion-funnel" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span data-preserver-spaces="true">web conversion funnel</span></a><span data-preserver-spaces="true">.</span></p>
