</ul>
<p>By taking consistent action for 3 months, you&#8217;ll be able to get the ball rolling and start working on projects you enjoy, and clients who are worth your time and effort.</p>
<p>The Infinite Deals Framework will give you enough inertia to confidently scale your agency without risking your well-being, working long hours, or living in uncertainty.</p>
