<p>With features like automated SMS activity triggers and phone number fields, businesses can <em>enhance their customer support and outreach</em>.</p>
<p><strong>41.6%</strong> of businesses use SMS for customer satisfaction surveys, and<strong> 39.3%</strong> use it for customer service and support.</p>
<p>By adopting <a href="/top-hubspot-sms-integration"><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px;"><span style="font-size: 1rem;">HubSpot</span></span><span style="font-size: 1rem;"> integration</span></a><span style="font-size: 1rem;"><a href="/top-hubspot-sms-integration"> for SMS integration</a>, companies can transform their communication strategies and achieve measurable results.</span></p>
