</li>
<li data-start="3103" data-end="3284">
<p data-start="3105" data-end="3284"><strong>The intake form is an innovative tool</strong>. It engages the visitor, primes the client to think in concrete terms (&#8220;What assets do you have?&#8221;), and gives the firm data ahead of the consult.</p>
