<p data-start="3840" data-end="4380">They have a strong track record with over 4,000 clients and more than 10,000 successful transactions.</p>
<p data-start="3840" data-end="4380">With over 68 years of combined experience, they emphasize personalized attention, strategic thinking, and clear communication, demonstrating their commitment to tailored, transparent legal services.</p>
