  (42394,'/ada-website-compliance-deadlines-2026','ada-website-compliance-deadlines-2026','post','blog','ADA Website Compliance Deadlines 2026: The Critical Compassion Gap','ADA Website Compliance Deadlines 2026: The Critical Compassion Gap','Your site is bouncing 1 in 4 patients before they ever see a clinician. ADA Website Compliance deadlines 2026 are the best excuse to fix it.','https://alphaefficiency.com/ada-website-compliance-deadlines-2026',1,'Your Conversion Rate Specialist is a scammer. He&#8217;s got you A/B testing red buttons against green ones. Debating hex codes. Running a 6-week test to lift conversion 0.4% (ignoring 27.6% of your total traffic nobody talks about). And here I am, colorblind, unable to tell his red button from his green one. While he chases &hellip; Continued','<div id="message-list_1780951303.345179" aria-setsize="-1">
