<td style="padding: 12px; border: 1px solid #d9d9d9; color: #1a4fa0; font-weight: bold;">Real alt text on every meaningful image</td>
<td style="padding: 12px; border: 1px solid #d9d9d9;">~2 hours per 100 images</td>
<td style="padding: 12px; border: 1px solid #d9d9d9;">Image search traffic, AI Overview citation eligibility</td>
</tr>
<tr style="background-color: #f4f7fb;">
<td style="padding: 12px; border: 1px solid #d9d9d9; color: #1a4fa0; font-weight: bold;">Color contrast pass on brand colors</td>
<td style="padding: 12px; border: 1px solid #d9d9d9;">~$400 design pass</td>
<td style="padding: 12px; border: 1px solid #d9d9d9;">Better readability for everyone, fewer support calls</td>
</tr>
