<td style="padding: 12px; border: 1px solid #d9d9d9; color: #1a4fa0; font-weight: bold;">Form labels in code, not just visual</td>
<td style="padding: 12px; border: 1px solid #d9d9d9;">~3 hours per form</td>
<td style="padding: 12px; border: 1px solid #d9d9d9;">Higher portal login success, less front-desk call volume</td>
</tr>
<tr style="background-color: #ffffff;">
<td style="padding: 12px; border: 1px solid #d9d9d9; color: #1a4fa0; font-weight: bold;">Clean heading structure across the site</td>
<td style="padding: 12px; border: 1px solid #d9d9d9;">~1 content audit</td>
<td style="padding: 12px; border: 1px solid #d9d9d9;">Featured snippets and AI Overview citations</td>
