<p>We are at the end of technological revolution,  but just entering into a new one, revolution of our minds. With the popularization of internet, every single human being is connected with another, allowing the birth of thousands and millions of new ideas.</p>
<p>Let us tell you what we want to achieve, with a help from a short story:</p>
<p>We have 12 billion neural cells within our brain cortex.  Each one of these cells is connected at all times with 100000 to 1 000 000 other cells at any given moment.  If we take the worse case scenario and multiply 12 billion with itself 100 000 times, we will get the number of possible connections within our cortex.  This number exceeds the number of particles in the known universe.  But we don&#8217;t want to stop there, we want to multiply this number by another 7 billion people on this planet.</p>
<p>We want to tap into this amazing intelectual superpower and inspire it to survive and thrive, despite our individual  differenceis. </p>
<p>Are you ready for the next wave of change? Are you ready to be a part of 21st renesciance? Dare to dream big, dare to become Alpha Efficient.</p>',NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','2011-10-12T17:28:58','2011-10-12T17:28:58',292,0,0),
