  (11815,'/alpha-efficiency-magazine-issue-2-communicating','alpha-efficiency-magazine-issue-2-communicating','page','blog','Issue 2: Communicating','Issue 2: Communicating - Alpha Efficiency','The Essential Communications Toolkit Developing Communications Mastery Communicating Your Way into a Better Career','https://alphaefficiency.com/alpha-efficiency-magazine-issue-2-communicating',1,'Alpha Efficiency Magazine – Second Edition &nbsp; The Essential Communications Toolkit Developing Communications Mastery Communicating Your Way into a Better Career Quitting your Social Media Addiction Mike Vardy: The Writer&#8217;s View on Communication &#8230;and more!','<h1></h1>
<h1></h1>
<h1></h1>
