<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Before commencing the SEO plan, take time to identify and fix the site’s flaws. These issues can drive up the costs of the SEO strategy, since they require a lot of fixing. You do not want to hand over your website to an SEO agency with poor quality backlinks, as they will need to be changed, which comes at a cost. Therefore, you should audit your site before implementing the SEO plan.</span><span style="font-weight: 400;"><br />
