  (16621,'/web-development-inverness-il','web-development-inverness-il','page','location','Why you should hire a web development company from Inverness to handle your website QA testing','Web development company near Inverness - Alpha Efficiency','Want to enhance your web? Alpha Efficiency is more than happy to provide you with the right tools and infrastructure for your web experience in Inverness, IL.','https://alphaefficiency.com/web-development-inverness-il',1,'After completing your web development process, you need quality assurance (QA) testing. If you have developers on your team, they might not go far ahead and look into QA testing. Therefore, you will need a web development company near Inverness to handle the last part to ensure that your site is tested for defects, and &hellip; Continued','<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">After completing your web development process, you need quality assurance (QA) testing. If you have developers on your team, they might not go far ahead and look into <a href="/qa-design-process">QA testing</a>. Therefore, you will need a web development company near Inverness to handle the last part to ensure that your site is tested for defects, and here’s why.</span><img src="https://alphaefficiency.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/webdevinverness-1.png" alt="web development inverness" width="800" height="600" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /></p>
<h2>It is a boost to unit testing</h2>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Developers usually perform unit testing during development, but it is not enough to ensure the quality of your project. They are mostly done with the code at this stage, and they might not dedicate as much time and focus on ensuring that the project is of high quality. They might be critical of the functionalities set during planning. It is common to find developers who do not pay much attention to testing, hence, the need for website QA testing.</span><span style="font-weight: 400;"><br />
</span></p>
<h2>Website QA testing is different</h2>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Depending on the type of methodology used in the development of your project, testing can occur in various phases. QA testing is different from regular testing, and it is a determinant for the success of your web development process in Inverness. It is unique from what the regular developers do, and in fact, it can seem like a nuisance to them. However, nothing is too perfect or accurate, as there might be unseen bugs and defects. A <a href="/">web design Chicago</a> team explains that even if they are not found the first time, they might still be present in the project.</span><span style="font-weight: 400;"><br />
</span></p>
<h2>It balances development and testing</h2>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">You might have the best development team, but without a suitable testing protocol, the project might not be as good as it should be. It should be up to the industry and technological standards, and with QA testing, you can achieve a high-quality product. QA testing can either be;</span></p>
<ul>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Manual</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Automated</span></li>
</ul>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Let’s take a look.</span><span style="font-weight: 400;"><br />
</span></p>
<h5>Manual QA testing</h5>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Individual QA analysts sit down and focus on your project to check its features and catch bugs. It is a hands-on approach for software validation without using any automation tools. Its efficiency depends on the level of skill of the QA analysts.</span></p>
<h5>Automated QA testing</h5>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">A script has custom instructions to execute certain commands to check for expected outcomes or target features. In this case, the QA analysts utilize scripts and automated tools for the process. They can create their own scripts to fit your project or come up with new ones depending on the scope of the work.</span><span style="font-weight: 400;"><br />
</span></p>
<h2>Final thoughts</h2>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">As you perfect your web development process in Inverness, you surely need QA testing. It is critical to ensure that you can achieve a high-quality product. It is like a break away from the primary development process, which usually has testing. However, QA testing is different as it is a more specialized way to ensure the completeness and efficiency of your website. QA testing should not be a one-time process, and it should be continuous to ensure user requirements, quick-release turnaround, and fast feedback.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">If you plan to outsource the whole process or just QA, then look no further than our <a href="/web-development-agency-chicago">web development company in Chicago</a>. <a href="/schedule-a-call">Schedule a call</a> with us today, and we’ll help you make you solve website bugs and make it flawless.</span></p>','https://alphaefficiency.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/webdevinverness-1.png','views/template-locations-single.blade.php','[]','[]','2022-03-03T12:09:23','2022-03-03T12:09:23',539,4,1),
  (16644,'/web-development-golf-il','web-development-golf-il','page','location','A web development company near Golf explains why you should stay away from website builders','Web development services near Golf - Alpha Efficiency','Looking for a team of web developers in Golf, IL? With Alpha Efficiency experts, you will receive quality and stability of your web experience.','https://alphaefficiency.com/web-development-golf-il',1,'Website builders are attractive because of their ease of use. You only need to drag and drop components, and your interface will be ready within no time. It is cheap and easy to access, but it is costly in the long run, as they will not tell you the problems you will experience. Issues include &hellip; Continued','<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Website builders are attractive because of their ease of use. You only need to drag and drop components, and your interface will be ready within no time. It is cheap and easy to access, but it is costly in the long run, as they will not tell you the problems you will experience. Issues include lack of community support and lousy SEO. As you start your web development process near Golf, you should hire a professional <a href="/">web design Chicago</a> team rather than opt for website builders. Let’s look at why you should stay away from website builders.</span></p>
