</span></p>
<h2>It does not give a professional look</h2>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Statistics reveal that about 97% of consumers now lookup services or products online before they decide to subscribe or buy. In the process, they also check how a website looks. A professional one will give them the confidence to browse through what they are looking for and trust your services. It would be best to opt for a web development company near Golf to help you create a professional site that will sit well with your customers. The first impression is critical to conversions, as consumers are quickly put off with poor designs, for example, if it looks amateur, confusing, or generic.</span><span style="font-weight: 400;"><br />
