</ul>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">You can break down the goals further, for example, into performance metrics and add more details and approaches. Keep in mind that not all PPC strategies are the same; a <a href="/ecommerce-ppc-management">PPC strategy for eCommerce</a> differs significantly from the one used by other industries.</span><span style="font-weight: 400;"><br />
