<h3>Technical SEO</h3>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Technical SEO encompasses all the SEO actions that don’t relate to content creation. They primarily focus on fixing website operation issues such as loading speeds, website architecture, and security.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Having a slow-loading website leads to potential customer loss on a daily basis. Also, if your website navigation resembles a digital maze, visitors are unlikely to spend more time and eventually become customers. Website architecture also plays a huge part in search engine optimization. For businesses that collect customers’ personal info, having a verified and secured website is mandatory.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Our SEO agency in Chicago will help you modernize your website and incorporate a professional look and feel that will set you apart from your competitors.</span></p>
<h3>SEO-Driven Content</h3>
<p><i><span style="font-weight: 400;">Content is king. (Bill Gates)</span></i></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Not all content is created equal. The one that our SEO agency in Chicago delivers is custom-made and targeted to maintain and improve your online presence by driving organic traffic and boosting keyword rankings.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">From press releases and blogging to journalistic writing and editing, each piece of content produced by our writing staff fulfills all of the following demands:</span></p>
<ul>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Proper length and readability</span></li>
