<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Correct formatting</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Relevant keywords</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Internal and external linking</span></li>
</ul>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Every industry offers an abundance of interesting topics to write about. Our trained staff will work closely with your PR team to learn as much as possible about your company and the way you represent yourself. Premium content requires more than just the talent for wordsmithing. What lies behind the scenes is an elaborate keyword clustering method that combines focused keywords along with long-tail keywords in order to achieve long-term goals such as increased referral traffic to your website and high organic ranking.</span></p>
<h3>Keyword Research Strategy</h3>
<p><i><span style="font-weight: 400;">The wisdom of life consists in the elimination of non-essentials. (Lin Yutang)</span></i></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Keywords are one of the crucial components of SEO strategy for formulating search results. Their value is mainly based on the number of people using these specific words in their search queries. However, a sound keyword strategy rests not only on the keywords you choose to include but also on those you omit. </span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">The list of most valuable keywords varies across industries. This is why businesses prioritize building keyword lists before launching campaigns. Our SEO team will determine the most potent target keywords for your industry and create an SEO strategy aimed at reaching your business goals. We excel at discovering underrepresented opportunities in high traffic searches.</span></p>
<h3>On-Page SEO</h3>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">On-page SEO refers to a set of actions that agencies like our SEO agency in Chicago take on your website pages. Working with our team of experts will ensure that your website is coded correctly with all the SEO tags and alt tags included in a way that will increase your visibility on Google and search engines alike.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">The SEO side of your website needs to be closely monitored due to the ever-changing search engine algorithms. In the past few years, Google is placing an increased emphasis on page loading speed as part of their core web vitals. Structured data is yet another major component of a successful SEO campaign. We will implement the best use practices to provide structured snippet placements that can land at the top of your page.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Our previous experience taught us that there is always room to expand on any pre-existing SEO efforts to ensure that your website is always up to date.</span></p>
<h3>Off-Page SEO</h3>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Off-page SEO takes place outside your website. It includes all the links, accounts, listings, or articles associated with your business. It’s one thing to write about your business. However, it makes a much stronger statement when others write about you. After all, the main goal of search engine optimization is to have a variety of sources mentioning your company in search queries related to your industry.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">One way of boosting your business’ off-page SEO is increasing your social media presence. The majority of people spend an impressive amount of time on various social media platforms. This is why a strong social media content creation strategy needs to include multiple platforms. Maintaining a consistent posting schedule can help you increase the followers&#8217; number leading to more interest in your business and therefore increasing your online visibility.</span></p>
<p><i><span style="font-weight: 400;">The man who moves a mountain begins by carrying away small stones. (Confucius)</span></i></p>
<h3>Link Building</h3>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Alpha Efficiency applies the latest link-building strategies to increase the number of links to your website. These valuable links, also known as backlinks, can be challenging to obtain. The entire process takes time and patience, as well as the constant creation of relevant content.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Building an elaborate network of internal and external links signals Google and other search engines to source your web pages for results. Our experts will help you increase the ranking of your website pages by incorporating links and indexing your content. We will also take care of any old, bad, or blacklisted links.</span></p>
<h3>Content Optimization</h3>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">While it is crucial to create new content often, it is equally important to refresh existing content from time to time in order to reap all the benefits of SEO. Working with online assets provides an option to track data and use the findings to improve strategy. Our team will send constant feedback regarding your website traffic, top-performing keywords, as well as overall site evaluation throughout your campaign.</span></p>
