  (17462,'/wordpress-maintenance-chicago','wordpress-maintenance-chicago','page','blog','The Best WordPress Maintenance Company in Chicago','The Best WordPress Maintenance Company in Chicago - Alpha Efficiency.™','Make the right decision. Put the future of your business in the hands of the WordPress maintenance Chicago professionals.','https://alphaefficiency.com/wordpress-maintenance-chicago',1,'Make the right decision. Put the future of your business and the lead-generating, money-making machine that your website should be in the hands of the WordPress maintenance Chicago professionals. Get a Premium WordPress Maintenance Plan at Our Agency in Chicago Running a website is an ongoing endeavor. However, not many website owners are aware of &hellip; Continued','<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Make the right decision. Put the future of your business and the lead-generating, money-making machine that your website should be in the hands of the WordPress maintenance Chicago professionals.</span></p>
<h2>Get a Premium WordPress Maintenance Plan at Our Agency in Chicago</h2>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Running a website is an ongoing endeavor. However, not many website owners are aware of all the aspects that need to be maintained, from website backups all the way to SEO and Analytics — and everything in between.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Websites with various code insufficiencies often display a lack of control over the plugins and third-party conflicts. If you tend to these problems in a timely manner, they will pile up leaving your company in a situation that is neither straightforward nor simple to resolve.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">As a company set for success, you owe it to your users to provide a safe surrounding in which they can explore your products and services. However, outdated plugins and malware can expose your website to all kinds of issues, tarnishing your brand reputation for good.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">WordPress website maintenance requires around-the-clock dedication. Failing to tackle this task on a regular basis only adds hours to an already demanding task. Resolving plugin issues and dealing with website vulnerabilities is only the tip of the iceberg. Just like running a successful business, there is so much more than meets the eye. Schedule a call with our team and let us add productive hours to your day by ensuring that your website’s health and functionality remain the least of your worries.</span></p>
<h2>Benefits of Hiring a Professional WordPress Maintenance Agency From Chicago</h2>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Due to its simplicity and ease of use, most people never stopped to think about what hides under the surface of WordPress websites. WordPress is actually a sophisticated and data-driven system with a ton of underlying source code. This is the main reason why it requires constant attention to remain stable and secure. Here are some of the benefits your business will enjoy if you decide to partner up with our WordPress maintenance agency in Chicago.</span></p>
<h2>Our WordPress Support Saves Your Time</h2>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">This is the most immediate benefit you will notice if you put your website support in our hands. When done by professionals, regular WordPress maintenance consumes up to 5 hours a week. If you are not a WordPress veteran, imagine how much of your time it may consume as you learn to handle tasks and troubleshoot problems. Our team takes this time off your busy schedule allowing you to focus on growing your business. By the end of each month, you’ll notice greater productivity and better business results from both you and the members of your staff.</span></p>
<h2>Alpha Efficiency Will Improve Your WordPress Website Security</h2>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Providing sensitive data security at all times is a top priority for every website owner. This is even more critical for eCommerce websites or businesses in healthcare and other specialized fields.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Ensuring that your themes and plugins are up to date is the first line of defense. However, this is commonly overlooked by website owners. We understand that it is hard to stay on top of all the newest patch releases and security update best practices while running the business at the same time. This is where the WordPress maintenance packages that our agency in Chicago offers come in very handy. All you have to do is schedule a call and rest assured that you no longer have to worry about keeping your website security at maximum level.</span></p>
<h2>We Provide Regular And Accessible WordPress Website Backups</h2>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Even in case you do encounter a serious problem with your website, our professionals have you covered. We’ll regularly back up your website, so in case any issues emerge, our team will get it up and running in no time.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">In case of a security breach, your entire website or parts of it may crash. By failing to provide regular backups, your only option would be to build the affected portions of the website from scratch. On the other hand, with accessible backups, our agency can restore your website in a matter of hours or even minutes.</span></p>
<h2>Our WordPress Maintenance Services Improve Your Website Performance</h2>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">With appealing content, engaging messaging, accurate brand reflection, and relevant links, your website will do an amazing job in communicating with your target audience. Our team can in turn deal with everything under the hood. We’ll identify and repair broken pages and links for you while maintaining SEO optimization and providing the ongoing compatibility of your themes and plugins. This will improve how your website performs overall and on SERP. As a result, your business will notice higher visibility while your customers enjoy a modern website with reliable performance. That kind of surroundings will encourage them to spend more time on your website and convert more frequently.</span></p>
<h2>The Most Valuable Service That Our Agency Provides</h2>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">One of the most valuable things Alpha Efficiency offers that is not listed in our services is the peace of mind you’ll enjoy knowing that your most precious business asset is in skilled and safe hands. <a href="/schedule-a-call">Schedule a call</a> and get your company the best WordPress maintenance services the industry has to offer.</span></p>','https://alphaefficiency.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/hero_image.png','views/template-services.blade.php','[]','[]','2022-04-12T09:58:45','2022-04-12T09:58:45',857,1,0),
