  (18082,'/ppc-agency-depaul-il','ppc-agency-depaul-il','page','location','A digital agency from DePaul breaks down the latest PPC trends','PPC in DePaul, IL Alpha Efficiency.™',NULL,'https://alphaefficiency.com/ppc-agency-depaul-il',1,'Business is competitive, and you keep up with marketing. PPC is a paid marketing strategy where you only spend when users click on your ads. It sounds simple right? But running down your budget is risky without achieving the desired results. At our PPC agency in Chicago, we keep up with the latest trends. Schedule &hellip; Continued','<p>Business is competitive, and you keep up with marketing. PPC is a paid marketing strategy where you only spend when users click on your ads. It sounds simple right? But running down your budget is risky without achieving the desired results. At our <a href="/ppc-agency-chicago" target="_blank" rel="noopener">PPC agency in Chicago</a>, we keep up with the latest trends. <a href="/schedule-a-call" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Schedule a call</a> with us so we can draw up a strategy to optimize your budget. We’ve compiled a list of the top trends you should have for your PPC in DePaul, IL. Let’s take a look.</p>

<h2>The latest PPC trends in DePaul, IL</h2>

<h4>Automating PPC</h4>
<p>Automation in <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pay-per-click" target="_blank" rel="noopener">PPC</a> brings a new dimension to the performance of marketing campaigns. Search engine algorithms analyze your marketing campaign. You should work to stay relevant by;</p>
<ul>
<li aria-level="1">Using negative keywords</li>
<li aria-level="1">Writing a good ad copy</li>
<li aria-level="1">Tracking your conversions</li>
</ul>
<p>The search engine algorithms will do most of the work for you by pushing your ads to the right sources. They also implement automatically optimized targeting. It ensures your campaign reaches the right audiences and leads to more conversions.</p>

<h4>Smart bidding</h4>
<p>Smart bidding is the automation of bidding strategies. It helps marketers get to their goals by optimizing their advertisements. When you enter your goals on the platform, Google Ads becomes more objective in pushing your ads. Some of the smart bidding strategies are;</p>
<ul>
<li aria-level="1">Target Return on Advertising Spend (ROAS)</li>
<li aria-level="1">Target Cost-Per-Acquisition (CPA)</li>
<li aria-level="1">Enhanced Cost-Per-Click (CPC)</li>
</ul>
<p>Through machine learning, smart bidding is getting better and more powerful. You also need a negative keyword list to improve the efficiency of the results.</p>

<h4>Artificial intelligence (AI) in PPC</h4>
<p>AI’s impact on tech is exceptional. Now, it’s taking a more significant role in PPC to do things such as;</p>
<ul>
<li aria-level="1">Optimizing keywords</li>
<li aria-level="1">Analyzing bids</li>
<li aria-level="1">Finding the likelihood of conversion</li>
<li aria-level="1">Checking the impact of ads</li>
<li aria-level="1">Predicting click-through-rates</li>
</ul>
<p>AI studies customer behavior and uses it to target marketing campaigns; therefore, it should be a driving force for the need of your PPC in DePaul, IL. You’ll enjoy the benefits of optimized ad campaigns. For example, it boosts your click-through rate.</p>

<h4>Entrance of Amazon to paid advertising</h4>
<p>Amazon is now a big player in paid advertising alongside Meta and Google. It’s a leader in the eCommerce sector and is now using its popularity for PPC. The main advantage it has over its competitors is buyer intent. More customers are looking to buy products, which improves conversion rates. So, you get more value on Amazon, yet you spend less. Google and Meta have the most numbers, but getting conversions is challenging. The Google Ads targeting expansion is a helpful way to achieve high efficiency on the search engine. So, it’s not always about the tool but how to use it.</p>

<h4>Video Ads</h4>
<p>Stats speak a lot about the changing marketing dynamic of video ads. They reveal that video ads now make up to about 82% of consumed content online. Video ads are not just on platforms like Youtube. It also applies to social media, like Instagram Stories or Reels. You combine it with Google Ads sitelinks for easy user access. It’s one marketing strategy you shouldn’t miss on your PPC in Hinsdale.</p>

<h4>Social media PPC strategies</h4>
<p>Social media plays a significant role in your PPC because it’s where you’ll find the most people. The most popular platforms are;</p>
<ul>
<li aria-level="1">Pinterest</li>
<li aria-level="1">LinkedIn</li>
<li aria-level="1">Instagram</li>
<li aria-level="1">Twitter</li>
<li aria-level="1">Facebook</li>
<li aria-level="1">TikTok</li>
</ul>
<p>The broad demographics give you options to target a specific audience. Utilize web design services to ensure you have an elegant landing page to connect to your socials.</p>

<h4>Google’s Ads Data Hub</h4>
<p>Before, pixels were useful to judge the effectiveness of ads. With Google Ads Data Hub, marketers get detailed measures and reports. It covers all types of screens, like mobile or desktop.</p>

<h4>YouTube’s growing dominance on TV</h4>
<p>YouTube is a big platform that has millions of creators. The rise of Smart TVs and casting allows it to expand to TV screens. YouTube introduced the Masthead. It’s like a billboard that displays only when used on TV. Your campaign will gain more clicks with the Google Ads sitelinks on the Masthead.</p>

<h4>Voice search</h4>
<p>AI allows users to use voice assistants on their smart devices to search. The popular ones are;</p>
<ul>
<li aria-level="1">Alexa</li>
<li aria-level="1">Google Assistant</li>
<li aria-level="1">Siri</li>
<li aria-level="1">Cortana</li>
</ul>
<p>It’s an opportunity for you to include a conversational tone when you edit your ad content. You will receive more ad impressions because you will be relevant to the voice searches.</p>

<h4>Visual search</h4>
<p>Visual search is another AI-based technology. Users can search for the products they want using a picture they have. It saves people’s time, for example, when they don’t know the name of what they are searching for. So, attach a diverse picture catalog with your ads so you can also appear among image searches.</p>

<h4>Final thoughts</h4>
<p>New PPC strategies emerge every time. It would be best if you had a professional SEO agency to guide you through your PPC in DePaul, IL. It will help you evolve with the PPC strategies. SEO services are also essential to optimize your web presence and marketing budget. If old strategies worked for you before, it doesn’t mean they’ll stay that way forever. Stay active to watch out for the latest marketing trends that will improve your business.</p>','https://alphaefficiency.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/08/ppcdepaul.png','views/template-locations-single.blade.php','[]','[]','2022-12-31T10:30:12','2022-12-31T10:30:12',879,2,0),
