<h4><i>Budget</i></h4>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">The advantage of PPC is that you can control your budget. Before investing, have a precise amount of how much you are willing to spend. A PPC agency will suggest the amount you should spend and the expected results. So, as you start, have a detailed review of the return on investment.</span></p>
<h4><i>Resources</i></h4>
