</ul>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">When you have the right keywords, your ads will get more clicks. Also, include a </span><span style="font-weight: 400;">negative keywords list</span><span style="font-weight: 400;">. You will avoid draining your budget when you display before the wrong audience.</span></p>
<h4><i>Generating Call to Actions (CTAs)</i></h4>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">You should have catchy call-to-actions. It depends on what you want to achieve from your PPC campaign. Your target audience should relate to the CTA and the brand you are advertising. So, when users click on your ads, they get what you advertised. False advertising will only hurt your budget and disappoint users.</span></p>
