  (18259,'/web-design-dunning-il','web-design-dunning-il','page','location','Looking for a reliable web design agency near Dunning, IL? We got you covered.','Reliable Web Design Dunning, IL - Alpha Efficiency.™','Your website not getting a lot of traffic? Do you think it might be your websites design? A Web Design Agency in Dunning, IL explains more.','https://alphaefficiency.com/web-design-dunning-il',1,'Finding the right, reliable and professional web design agency to create or redesign your website into a functional and effective one is a challenging, but essential task. Web design plays a crucial role in attracting customers and providing a good user experience that leads to conversion and business prosperity. That is why the success of &hellip; Continued','<p>Finding the right, reliable and professional web design agency to create or redesign your website into a functional and effective one is a challenging, but essential task. Web design plays a crucial role in attracting customers and providing a good user experience that leads to conversion and business prosperity. That is why the success of the website and online business depends on quality web design. Hence, the importance of whom you will entrust with the design of your website. If you are searching for a good web design agency near Dunning, IL, we assure you that our company is the convenient choice. Here are the questions and tips to consider when deciding on the agency and the reasons why our company stands as a prestigious one in web design.</p>
<h4>Review agency experience and portfolio</h4>
<p>When choosing the right agency to create the design of your site, examine if the company has experience in your industry niche and company size. Specific industry domain demands a specific approach and requirements. Experienced web design agencies are usually more competent in creating a particular design that corresponds with the particular business nature. The portfolio is a great material to look at whatever the agency has worked on similar projects and whether it will manage to fit your needs. <a href="/portfolio">Check our portfolio</a> section on our agency website and see examples of our work that will walk you through our skills, capacity, creativity, and industry experience.</p>
<h4>Read testimonies and customer reviews</h4>
<p>Online reviews and testimonies are an excellent way to find an objective opinion about the company and are the clients happy with their websites. Many clients leave the name of specific team members that have worked on their projects with whom they were particularly satisfied or not pleased during cooperation. Take a look at customers&#8217; reviews of <a href="/">Alpha Efficiency</a> and check why we are valued as a trustful and professional agency by clients.</p>
<h4>What content management system does the company use in site building?</h4>
<p>A content management system (CMS) is the spine of the website. While custom web design mainly uses the software WordPress in constructing a website, besides WordPress, agencies are specialized in working with Squarespace, Joomla, HubSpot, Wix, and others. Interrogate your potential partner agency on which CMS they prefer and consider using for constructing your website.</p>
<h4>Does the agency provide website marketing?</h4>
<p>Great web design agencies are competent to cover various fields of design-related specializations. Excellent web design is insufficient without a good marketing strategy for increasing brand awareness and converting visitors into buyers. Specializations in different types of marketing are what makes a web design agency near Dunning, IL, reputable in the web design industry. Our company&#8217;s advantage is that we can provide you with a superior marketing strategy after establishing your website. These strategies consider ad distribution through all digital channels such as social media, email marketing (<a href="/html-email-templates">design HTML email templates</a> and plain text versions), content marketing, and others.</p>
<h4>Ask the company about the post-launch website and support.</h4>
<p>A reliable web design agency will support its clients after establishing and launching the website. Every excellent web design company knows that launching the website is only the beginning of the collaboration and by no means the end. Post-activation bears regular examination of data and analysis that requires continuous development. Our <a href="/">web design agency in Chicago</a> cares about its clients and takes cooperation seriously, delivering support and assistance after the web design work is done.</p>
<h4>Does the company provide any Quality Assurance?</h4>
<p>As Quality Assurance (QA) can be difficult and take a lot of time depending on website complexity, you might want a team of experts to perform this task so that you can focus on your daily occupations. Additionally, our agency has made and displayed the <a href="/website-quality-assurance-checklist">website QA checklist</a> with stages in the testing process. The listed activities will help you detect issues related to web design, such as bugs, weaknesses, errors, and potential malfunctions that can be arranged before they emerge. QA checklist is one of the features our agency uses in the designing process before website development, which guarantees functionality and correct working of web design properties.</p>
<h2>Final Thoughts</h2>
<p>Hopefully, we have acknowledged you with the advantages and benefits of hiring our web design agency near Dunning, IL. As proven experts in web design, our company is capable of responding to all challenges and clients&#8217; demands. <a href="/schedule-a-call">Schedule a call</a> with our agency to achieve your goals together and make something big.</p>','https://alphaefficiency.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/webdesigndunning.png','views/template-locations-single.blade.php','[]','[]','2023-03-11T09:47:14','2023-03-11T09:47:14',743,6,0),
  (18284,'/alex','alex','page','template','Alex','Alex - Alpha Efficiency.™','A brilliant addition of Alpha Efficiency design team, Alex strives to make his designs unique and tailored to the clients needs.','https://alphaefficiency.com/alex',1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'views/template-about-single.blade.php','[]','[]','2022-10-13T01:57:36','2022-10-13T01:57:36',0,0,0),
  (18642,'/seo-agency-skokie-il','seo-agency-skokie-il','page','location','An SEO agency in Skokie, IL explains the importance of word count for SEO','SEO agency in Skokie, IL - Alpha Efficiency','Besides word count, the articles need to be an informative piece and high-quality written for the best SEO ranking in Skokie, IL. ','https://alphaefficiency.com/seo-agency-skokie-il',1,'SEO or search engine optimization is a practice that improves the ranking in search engines. It’s the most powerful marketing tactic for improving the quality of your website. Ranking higher in search engines gives you an excellent chance to reach a greater audience for your business. As an SEO company in Chicago, we can say &hellip; Continued','<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">SEO or search engine optimization is a practice that improves the ranking in search engines. It’s the most powerful marketing tactic for improving the quality of your website. Ranking higher in search engines gives you an excellent chance to reach a greater audience for your business. </span><span style="font-weight: 400;">As an </span><a href="/seo-agency-chicago"><span style="font-weight: 400;">SEO company in Chicago</span></a><span style="font-weight: 400;">, we can say that word count is one of the most important factors for good ranking. When the text is longer, there’s more chance to determine what it’s about. The longer the text, the more keyword phrases appear. But overstuffing your text with that keyphrase won’t change that much. It’s better to spread it throughout the whole text and let the keyword pop up here and there. Besides word count, the articles need to be an informative piece and high-quality written for the best </span><span style="font-weight: 400;">SEO </span><span style="font-weight: 400;">ranking in </span><span style="font-weight: 400;">Skokie, IL</span><span style="font-weight: 400;">. </span></p>
<h2>How to achieve your target word count</h2>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">By overstuffing an article’s content with keywords and key phrases, you can reach the target word count, but you can lose readers, which is the opposite of what you want. What you can do is:</span></p>
<h5>Use headings to break up the subject into subtopics</h5>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Headings within the text serve a few purposes. They show a hierarchy of the article, allow readers to scan the article, know what it’s about, and make it more pleasant to read.</span></p>
<h5>Write tutorials</h5>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Thoroughly explain everything and provide details. You should put yourself in the reader’s situation and ask yourself whether you would understand the article. Use simple language, short sentences, and bullets. </span></p>
<h2>Is there a suggested word count that works best for SEO if you’re in Skokie, IL?</h2>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Yes, there is a number that is considered an average word count for different types of articles, and it can be used as a benchmark for your content. </span></p>
<h5>Blog post</h5>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">For most websites, blog posts and articles, which make up most content, should have anywhere from 300 to 1000 words. However, according to <a href="/website-copywriting-services-chicago">copywriting experts in Chicago</a>, long-form articles are popular nowadays, and their word count should be closer to 1500 words.</span></p>
<h5>Educational content</h5>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">This type of content should be more extended because, in order to educate someone on something they’re not familiar with, the article needs to have detailed instructions and explanations. To rank best for educational content, the average word count you should aim for is 2000. </span></p>
<h5>Product pages</h5>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">A page should have attractive pictures followed by a description to present a product to customers. A length that highlights products features, benefits, and product description should have approximately 300 words &#8211; just enough to incorporate everything about the product and essential keywords.</span></p>
<h5>News articles</h5>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">News-based articles should ideally be between 500 and 800 words. This length is enough to include relevant details without going off-topic.</span></p>
<h5>Landing pages</h5>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">The ideal length for this type of article is also around 500 words. That’s enough to get to the point and provide readers with adequate information.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Not only can Google punish you for thin content, but it can affect your business, and you can end up losing readers. To determine the correct word count for your matter, you should first know what’s too short. Secondly, you should build the length as naturally as possible and not overstuff the article just to hit the target word count.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">To conclude, Google does rank longer articles higher, but that doesn’t mean you should just add content for the sake of it. People don’t want to read long articles written poorly. For better </span><span style="font-weight: 400;">SEO </span><span style="font-weight: 400;">in </span><span style="font-weight: 400;">Skokie, IL</span><span style="font-weight: 400;">, quality and user-friendly articles still come first! Make sure you provide relevant and unique information linked to the article’s title.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">A lot more affects SEO and word counts, like shareability, <a href="/backlink-analysis-101">backlink analysis</a>, and conversions, so feel free to </span><span style="font-weight: 400;">schedule a call</span><span style="font-weight: 400;"> with us as we can help you work it all out!</span></p>',NULL,'views/template-locations-single.blade.php','[]','[]','2023-01-12T13:12:46','2023-01-12T13:12:46',641,3,0),
