<h2><span data-preserver-spaces="true">How important is Web Design in 2023?</span></h2>
<p><span data-preserver-spaces="true">We move into 2023, and the technologies and mediums for a business to connect with customers are constantly changing. Some may think that with social media campaigns, apps, browser extensions, and other technologies, websites are not as essential as they used to be a few years ago. That could not be further from the truth.</span></p>
