<h2><span data-preserver-spaces="true">How to reach Google&#8217;s Front Page</span></h2>
<p><span data-preserver-spaces="true">Did you know that 70% of internet users only focus on the first ten results of Google? Most users never scroll past the first page of search engine result pages. And the top 3 results get most of the attention. You see how important it is for your business website to rank high on search engines if you want users to find it. The way to take your site to Google&#8217;s front page is through search engine optimization, or SEO for short.</span></p>
<p><span data-preserver-spaces="true">SEO best practices help you optimize your website to rank high on SERPs. Where do our web dev services fall into all this? User experience has become a crucial factor search engines assess when crawling your website. Creating unique, relevant, and keyword-optimized content for your website is not enough; SEO goes further than that. Here are seven elements search engines consider when scanning your business website design:</span></p>
