<p>Suburbs such as Oak Park and Evanston need their own dedicated pages, because Google treats them as distinct markets from Chicago proper. The campaign we build for <a href="/local-seo-oak-park">the Oak Park market</a> targets different queries than the one we run for the Loop.</p>
