<li>For a boutique in Wicker Park, we refresh GBP photos each week.</li>
</ul>
<h2>What Goes Into a Local SEO Chicago Campaign</h2>
<p>We build campaigns around the four levers that move the top local pack, local organic ranking, and revenue. Each lever is built to add measurable value to the business.</p>
