UPDATE pages SET body_html = COALESCE(body_html,'') || '<p><span data-preserver-spaces="true">Sifting through the vast market of small business tools can be frustrating. With hundreds of software solutions available, each promising transformative result, how do you decide which ones are right for your business? After all, you&#8217;re tired of pouring your small business resources into tools that ultimately don&#8217;t align with your ecosystem. You don&#8217;t want to waste more time and money without getting closer to your goals&#8230;</span></p>
