<p><span data-preserver-spaces="true">To help you find the perfect software for your needs, my digital agency has created <strong>a list of 90 top-performing small business tools for 2023</strong>. However, I don&#8217;t want you to make the same mistakes I&#8217;ve made on the growth journey. That&#8217;s why I&#8217;ll also give you a set of <strong>six critical questions you should always ask before committing to a tool</strong>. Those questions will help you immediately know whether an app is a perfect match for your company or not.</span></p>
