</ul>
<h4>27. Monday.com</h4>
<p><span data-preserver-spaces="true">Monday.com started out in 2014 as a collaboration tool. However, I was surprised by its recent shift toward becoming an all-in-one project management tool. Its suite caters to diverse workflows such as customer relationship management (CRM), project management, software development, human resources (HR), marketing, and several others.</span></p>
