</ul>
<p><strong><span data-preserver-spaces="true">Price: </span></strong><span data-preserver-spaces="true">The Essential plan starts at $45 per month; the Ultimate Control plan starts at $89 per month.</span></p>
<h4>29. Basecamp</h4>
<p><span data-preserver-spaces="true">Basecamp positions itself as a fusion of team communication and project management, designed with remote teams in mind. However, it&#8217;s not as intricate in its project management capabilities as other specialized tools. For example, Basecamp is missing multiple project views and task priorities. But the emphasis on communication actually makes it a standout among other small business tools I&#8217;ve listed in this category. If you&#8217;re a remote team that values efficient communication and basic task management without the need for separate tools, Basecamp is worth consideration.</span></p>
