<li><strong><span data-preserver-spaces="true">Document Sharing and File Storage:</span></strong><span data-preserver-spaces="true"> Centralize documents and files relevant to projects, making them easily accessible to the team.</span></li>
<li><strong><span data-preserver-spaces="true">Notification Management:</span></strong><span data-preserver-spaces="true"> Tailor notifications based on user preference, optimizing communication without overwhelming team members.</span></li>
</ul>
<p><strong><span data-preserver-spaces="true">Pros</span></strong><span data-preserver-spaces="true">:</span></p>
<ul>
<li><span data-preserver-spaces="true">Easy to navigate, ensuring a smooth onboarding experience.</span></li>
<li><span data-preserver-spaces="true">Allows all project-related discussions to be contained within the project, minimizing distractions.</span></li>
<li><span data-preserver-spaces="true">Offers a low-cost per-user plan and a comprehensive Pro Unlimited plan.</span></li>
<li><span data-preserver-spaces="true">Combines project management and team communication tools, ideal for remote teams with limited resources.</span></li>
</ul>
<p><strong><span data-preserver-spaces="true">Cons:</span></strong></p>
