</ul>
<h4>30. Zoho Projects</h4>
<p><span data-preserver-spaces="true">Zoho Projects is a versatile project management platform tailored for businesses that prioritize organization and collaboration. Catering primarily to small teams, especially those with budget constraints, Zoho Projects offers tools to streamline tasks and project activities.</span></p>
<p><span data-preserver-spaces="true">While the software provides a comprehensive range of core project management functionalities, such as Gantt charts and resource management, it remains accessible and user-friendly, albeit with a bit of a learning curve for mastering all its capabilities. Zoho Projects is one of my main recommendations if you&#8217;re on a tight budget.</span></p>
