<h4>41. Telegram</h4>
<p><span data-preserver-spaces="true">Telegram is an instant messaging app that can become essential to your company&#8217;s marketing strategy. While often compared with WhatsApp, Telegram offers a unique set of features. An attribute that highly benefits businesses is that users can save their entire data &#8211; chats, voice messages, documents, images, and other files &#8211; on the cloud. Telegram allows communication without phone numbers; users can find each other by searching for their usernames. Another helpful feature is channels. By creating channels with relevant keywords, you can attract users to your company and grow visibility and engagement. So, Telegram can also be a marketing channel, not just a communication tool for your small business.</span></p>
