<h4>85. Xero</h4>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Xero is the popular invoicing software for small businesses, focused on companies with less complex finance management needs. This platform has a solid range of tools for accounting and invoice management, but it requires some extent of time for learning. You might also find Xero pricy for software of its range, but it really depends on whether you’ll be using all of its features or not.</span></p>
