<h4>86. Stripe</h4>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Stripe is a popular payment processing platform for assisting electronic transactions for businesses of all sizes. I highly recommend it for online-only businesses and B2B companies. This platform is highly customizable, offers a wide range of integrations, and supports over 135 currencies. The pricing and fees can be higher, but the features usually make Stripe worth it.</span></p>
