<ul>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Supports a wide range of integrations</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Easy transaction process</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Protects you as a seller with various mechanisms</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Free withdrawals to your bank account, and if you don’t want to wait 3-5 days, you can withdraw funds instantly for a 1.5% fee.</span></li>
</ul>
<p><strong>Cons:</strong></p>
<ul>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">It can be hard to reach their customer service.</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Not an ideal choice for high-risk merchants</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Confusing transaction fees, with different rates depending on payment methods</span></li>
</ul>
<h4>88. TurboTax</h4>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">When it comes to efficient and reliable tax software for small businesses, TurboTax has maintained its reputation as a leader for decades. With tax laws frequently evolving, it’s crucial to have software that stays updated, and TurboTax&#8217;s streamlined approach does precisely that. For small business owners, I recommend the Self-Employed package, as iit offers features that maximize deductions while providing a comprehensive way to report both personal and business incomes, along with other financial nuances.</span></p>
<p><strong>Key Features:</strong></p>
<ul>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Tax Refund Calculator</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Tax Bracket Calculator</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">W-4 Withholding Calculator</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Self-Employed Expense Estimator</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Dedicated Tax Expert Help</span></li>
</ul>
<p><strong>Pros:</strong></p>
<ul>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Offers on-demand advice and a final review by a tax expert for added assurance.</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Allows a tax professional to prepare, sign, and file your return on your behalf.</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Accuracy and Refund Assurance: Guarantees correct calculations and maximizes potential refunds.</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Offers free guidance and assistance in the event of IRS or other tax-related inquiries.</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">It’s possible to start filling your taxes on a desktop and then continue on your mobile device.</span></li>
</ul>
<p><strong>Cons:</strong></p>
<ul>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Opting for live expert advice can add to the overall cost.</span></li>
</ul>
<h4>89. Dropbox Sign</h4>
<p>Dropbox Sign offers a seamless and secure method for obtaining and requesting online signatures. Initially known as HelloSign, this tool has been rebranded and incorporated under the Dropbox umbrella, bringing the reliability and reputation of Dropbox into the realm of electronic signatures. Whether dealing with NDAs, sales contracts, or employee onboarding documents, Dropbox Sign ensures each signature is legally valid and compliant. For small businesses seeking efficiency, this tool bridges the gap between traditional signing methods and the need for quick, online authentication.</p>
<p>I recommend Dropbox Sign particularly for its blend of signature capabilities and document storage. This combination makes it a valuable asset in the suite of small business tools.</p>
<p><strong>Key Features:</strong></p>
<ul>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Reusable Templates</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Mobile-Friendly Forms</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">No-Code Integrations</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Mobile Signing</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Customizable Experiences</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Qualified Electronic Signatures</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Reminders and Notifications</span></li>
</ul>
<p><strong>Pros:</strong></p>
<ul>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Eliminates the need for printing, scanning, or physical dispatch.</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Each document gets a court-admissible audit trail, safeguarding all involved parties.</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Harmonizes with platforms like Salesforce, HubSpot CRM, and Microsoft Word.</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">All finalized documents are safely stored in your preferred cloud storage, be it Google Drive, Dropbox, or other platforms.</span></li>
</ul>
<p><strong>Cons:</strong></p>
<ul>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Some users find navigating the template features to be less than intuitive.</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">There have been sporadic reports of hitches while sending documents.</span></li>
</ul>
<h4>90. DocuSign</h4>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">When I first integrated DocuSign into my workflow, the difference was immediately noticeable. DocuSign’s ease of use, combined with its extensive features meant I could handle document management much more efficiently. Its focus on collaborative work allows multiple parties to prepare, dispatch, review, and sign documents, making it a solid choice for both internal and external use. Also, if you’re using Salesforce, you’ll be able to generate documents directly from this CRM, thanks to its native integration with DocuSign.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">So, if you&#8217;re operating a remote team or dealing with frequent document transactions, I highly recommend at least signing up for this e-Signature platform’s free trial.</span></p>
<p><strong>Key Features:</strong></p>
<ul>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Electronic Signatures</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Electronic Notarization</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Document Generation from Salesforce</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Audit Trail</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Reminders and Notifications</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Templates</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Mobile App</span></li>
</ul>
<p><strong>Pros:</strong></p>
<ul>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">User-Friendly Interface</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Versatility</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Designed for teamwork, DocuSign allows multiple recipients to review, sign, or store documents.</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Long free trial</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Despite its simplicity, it doesn&#8217;t compromise on advanced features that can be a boon for businesses.</span></li>
</ul>
<p><strong>Cons:</strong></p>
<ul>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">I found the registration process a bit lengthy.</span></li>
</ul>
<h2 id="your-turn">It&#8217;s Time To Choose Your Small Businesses Tools</h2>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Every software choice you make has the potential to set the trajectory for your business&#8217;s success. The tools you use play a crucial role in shaping your workflows, enhancing productivity, and driving growth.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">To ensure you make the best decisions for your business, revisit the six questions I mentioned at the beginning of this article:</span></p>
<ol>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Does it fit the rest of my business ecosystem?</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Does it solve my actual problems?</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Does it align with my tech skills, and is it easy to use for my team?</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Can I effectively use it on a smartphone?</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Does it suit my budget?</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Does it come with extensive support?</span></li>
</ol>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">And remember &#8211;<strong> life is too short to be stuck with software you don’t love using</strong>. Be picky and select tools that meet your current needs and also empower your future ambitions.</span></p>' WHERE path = '/small-business-tools';
